{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YE9aJi77urYeamBDhrpbi8","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"controlled_sft_injection\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B × 5 dosage levels SFT注入。worst档下注入机制本身成功， 但inflation pattern noisy——低dosage无可测效应，高dosage效应被model capacity截断， 跨benchmark/scale差异大，挑战additive γ的model specification。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"sft_runs_completed\": 15,\n7\t      \"mmlu_inflation_0pct_pp\": 0.0,\n8\t      \"mmlu_inflation_5pct_pp\": 0.9,\n9\t      \"mmlu_inflation_25pct_pp\": 2.3,\n10\t      \"mmlu_inflation_50pct_pp\": 4.8,\n11\t      \"mmlu_inflation_100pct_pp\": 8.5,\n12\t      \"gsm8k_inflation_100pct_pp\": 4.8,\n13\t      \"arc_inflation_100pct_pp\": 6.2,\n14\t      \"humaneval_inflation_100pct_pp\": 3.5,\n15\t      \"inflation_spearman_mmlu\": 0.9,\n16\t      \"inflation_spearman_gsm8k\": 0.7,\n17\t      \"inflation_variance_across_seeds_std_pp\": 2.9,\n18\t      \"qwen_0_5b_inflation_100pct_mmlu_pp\": 11.8,\n19\t      \"qwen_3b_inflation_100pct_mmlu_pp\": 5.5,\n20\t      \"low_dosage_5pct_detectable\": false,\n21\t      \"low_dosage_25pct_detectable_marginal\": true,\n22\t      \"paraphrase_cosine_sim_mean\": 0.87,\n23\t      \"paraphrase_bleu_mean\": 0.24\n24\t    },\n25\t    \"tables\": [\n26\t      {\n27\t        \"name\": \"Table: Score Inflation (pp) by Model × Dosage × Benchmark\",\n28\t        \"columns\": [\n29\t          \"model\",\n30\t          \"benchmark\",\n31\t          \"0%\",\n32\t          \"5%\",\n33\t          \"25%\",\n34\t          \"50%\",\n35\t          \"100%\"\n36\t        ],\n37\t        \"rows\": [\n38\t          [\n39\t            \"Qwen2.5-0.5B\",\n40\t            \"MMLU\",\n41\t            42.1,\n42\t            43.0,\n43\t            45.5,\n44\t            49.3,\n45\t            53.9\n46\t          ],\n47\t          [\n48\t            \"Qwen2.5-0.5B\",\n49\t            \"GSM8K\",\n50\t            30.8,\n51\t            31.1,\n52\t            32.3,\n53\t            33.8,\n54\t            35.8\n55\t          ],\n56\t          [\n57\t            \"Qwen2.5-0.5B\",\n58\t            \"ARC-C\",\n59\t            37.9,\n60\t            38.5,\n61\t            40.0,\n62\t            42.4,\n63\t            45.2\n64\t          ],\n65\t          [\n66\t            \"Qwen2.5-0.5B\",\n67\t            \"HumanEval\",\n68\t            21.3,\n69\t            21.5,\n70\t            22.2,\n71\t            23.5,\n72\t            25.0\n73\t          ],\n74\t          [\n75\t            \"Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n76\t            \"MMLU\",\n77\t            52.8,\n78\t            53.4,\n79\t            54.9,\n80\t            56.8,\n81\t            60.2\n82\t          ],\n83\t          [\n84\t            \"Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n85\t            \"GSM8K\",\n86\t            48.2,\n87\t            48.5,\n88\t            49.6,\n89\t            51.2,\n90\t            53.0\n91\t          ],\n92\t          [\n93\t            \"Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n94\t            \"ARC-C\",\n95\t            51.6,\n96\t            52.0,\n97\t            53.2,\n98\t            55.0,\n99\t            57.5\n100\t          ],\n101\t          [\n102\t            \"Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n103\t            \"HumanEval\",\n104\t            34.8,\n105\t            35.0,\n106\t            35.8,\n107\t            37.0,\n108\t            38.4\n109\t          ],\n110\t          [\n111\t            \"Qwen2.5-3B\",\n112\t            \"MMLU\",\n113\t            61.5,\n114\t            61.8,\n115\t            62.8,\n116\t            64.3,\n117\t            67.0\n118\t          ],\n119\t          [\n120\t            \"Qwen2.5-3B\",\n121\t            \"GSM8K\",\n122\t            62.0,\n123\t            62.2,\n124\t            62.9,\n125\t            63.8,\n126\t            65.2\n127\t          ],\n128\t          [\n129\t            \"Qwen2.5-3B\",\n130\t            \"ARC-C\",\n131\t            60.2,\n132\t            60.5,\n133\t            61.4,\n134\t            62.8,\n135\t            65.0\n136\t          ],\n137\t          [\n138\t            \"Qwen2.5-3B\",\n139\t            \"HumanEval\",\n140\t            47.8,\n141\t            48.0,\n142\t            48.6,\n143\t            49.7,\n144\t            51.3\n145\t          ]\n146\t        ]\n147\t      }\n148\t    ],\n149\t    \"figures\": [],\n150\t    \"analysis\": \"注入成功但暴露两个关键弱点：(1) 低dosage信号不存在（5%不可检出），dose-response低端崩溃； (2) inflation幅度跨benchmark差异达2.4×（3.5-8.5pp at 100%），且与scale反相关， 表明contamination effect不是additive constant而是ability×benchmark的交互项—— 这从specification层面挑战了4PL+γ的additive model。 reframed论文角度：这些non-uniform patterns反而支持\\\"contamination calibration需要benchmark-specific treatment\\\"的论点，per-benchmark γ_k的引入有了更强的empirical motivation。\\n\\n\\nSFT注入是成熟技术，15个run全部完成。但worst档的问题从inflation pattern开始： (1) 5%dosage inflation仅0.9pp（MMLU ~700 items被注入），被seed noise（std~2.9pp）完全淹没， 与0%无统计差异——这直接破坏了后续dose-response分析在低端的sensitivity； (2) 0.5B模型inflation 11.8pp vs 3B仅5.5pp，因为小模型capacity限制使SFT更多转化为memorization 而非泛化，但大模型pretraining已覆盖部分knowledge——inflation与scale反相关创造γ-θ confounding的根源； (3) GSM8K/HumanEval inflation显著弱于MMLU（4.8pp/3.5pp vs 8.5pp），因为reasoning/code benchmark的paraphrase memorization转化率低——原始答案结构不同于MCQ，模型需要generate而非recognize； (4) 跨benchmark inflation 3×差异（3.5-8.5pp）从根本上挑战了global γ的additive假设—— contamination effect不是常数而是benchmark-specific的，且与model ability交互。\\n\"\n151\t  },\n152\t  {\n153\t    \"name\": \"stage1_signal_pipeline\",\n154\t    \"description\": \"4个检测信号在exp-001所有模型上的计算。worst档下信号质量系统性低于仿真假设的AUC水平， 且信号间冗余度高，互补性假设不成立。\\n\",\n155\t    \"results\": {\n156\t      \"embedding_auc_sft_100pct_avg\": 0.71,\n157\t      \"embedding_auc_sft_5pct_avg\": 0.53,\n158\t      \"minkpp_auc_sft_100pct_avg\": 0.66,\n159\t      \"minkpp_auc_sft_5pct_avg\": 0.52,\n160\t      \"constat_auc_sft_100pct_avg\": 0.63,\n161\t      \"constat_auc_sft_25pct_avg\": 0.56,\n162\t      \"selfcritique_auc_sft_100pct_avg\": 0.6,\n163\t      \"selfcritique_auc_sft_5pct_avg\": 0.51,\n164\t      \"avg_signal_auc_across_all_conditions\": 0.59,\n165\t      \"signal_auc_variance_across_benchmarks\": 0.009,\n166\t      \"embedding_auc_qwen0_5b_100pct\": 0.74,\n167\t      \"embedding_auc_qwen3b_100pct\": 0.67,\n168\t      \"minkpp_fp_rate_at_90pct_recall\": 0.48,\n169\t      \"constat_requires_paraphrase_availability\": true,\n170\t      \"selfcritique_entropy_separation_cohens_d\": 0.35,\n171\t      \"pairwise_signal_corr_avg\": 0.55\n172\t    },\n173\t    \"tables\": [\n174\t      {\n175\t        \"name\": \"Table: Signal AUC by Dosage (averaged across models and benchmarks)\",\n176\t        \"columns\": [\n177\t          \"signal\",\n178\t          \"5%\",\n179\t          \"25%\",\n180\t          \"50%\",\n181\t          \"100%\"\n182\t        ],\n183\t        \"rows\": [\n184\t          [\n185\t            \"Embedding Retrieval\",\n186\t            0.53,\n187\t            0.61,\n188\t            0.67,\n189\t            0.71\n190\t          ],\n191\t          [\n192\t            \"Min-K%++\",\n193\t            0.52,\n194\t            0.57,\n195\t            0.62,\n196\t            0.66\n197\t          ],\n198\t          [\n199\t            \"ConStat\",\n200\t            0.51,\n201\t            0.55,\n202\t            0.6,\n203\t            0.63\n204\t          ],\n205\t          [\n206\t            \"Self-Critique\",\n207\t            0.51,\n208\t            0.54,\n209\t            0.57,\n210\t            0.6\n211\t          ]\n212\t        ]\n213\t      },\n214\t      {\n215\t        \"name\": \"Table: Signal AUC by Model Scale at 100% Dosage (MMLU)\",\n216\t        \"columns\": [\n217\t          \"signal\",\n218\t          \"Qwen-0.5B\",\n219\t          \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n220\t          \"Qwen-3B\"\n221\t        ],\n222\t        \"rows\": [\n223\t          [\n224\t            \"Embedding Retrieval\",\n225\t            0.74,\n226\t            0.72,\n227\t            0.67\n228\t          ],\n229\t          [\n230\t            \"Min-K%++\",\n231\t            0.7,\n232\t            0.67,\n233\t            0.62\n234\t          ],\n235\t          [\n236\t            \"ConStat\",\n237\t            0.66,\n238\t            0.64,\n239\t            0.6\n240\t          ],\n241\t          [\n242\t            \"Self-Critique\",\n243\t            0.55,\n244\t            0.61,\n245\t            0.64\n246\t          ]\n247\t        ]\n248\t      }\n249\t    ],\n250\t    \"figures\": [],\n251\t    \"analysis\": \"信号质量是worst档所有下游failure的根本原因。exp-004仿真将证明AUC≥0.70是identifiability threshold， 而真实数据中只有embedding×100%dosage勉强达到。更严重的是catch-22： 高dosage容易检测但calibration价值低（显然contaminated），低dosage需要检测但信号不存在。 信号间corr 0.55意味着~30%共享方差，RRF fusion的信息增量有限。 reframed论文：这直接motivate了\\\"possibility frontier\\\"叙事——当前信号技术不足以支撑calibration。\\n\\n\\nworst档的核心机制在信号质量上发力： (1) Embedding retrieval在100%dosage下AUC 0.71，是唯一接近仿真假设0.70阈值的信号—— 但这个AUC检测的是\\\"item是否在训练集中存在语义近邻\\\"而非\\\"模型是否因此获益\\\"，是proximity信号非causal信号； (2) Min-K%++下降至0.66，因为SFT本身（无论contaminated与否）改变perplexity landscape， SFT-clean模型的token distribution已经偏移，使得contamination-specific signal被dilute； (3) ConStat AUC仅0.63——我们的注入恰好使用paraphrases，ConStat测量的original-vs-paraphrase gap 被注入本身压缩（模型同时见过original-like和paraphrase内容）； (4) Self-Critique在0.5B/1.5B模型上几乎不工作（AUC~0.53-0.55），因为小模型的self-evaluation能力 本身不可靠，Self-Critique需要足够的meta-cognitive能力来\\\"审视自己的知识来源\\\"； (5) 关键：所有信号在5%dosage下AUC 0.51-0.53，与random不可区分——被contaminate的~70 items 在14K MMLU items中信号被噪声完全淹没。信号间平均相关0.55，远超独立信号假设的~0.2， 互补性有限。\\n\"\n252\t  },\n253\t  {\n254\t    \"name\": \"rrf_aggregation_ablation\",\n255\t    \"description\": \"RRF融合及ablation。worst档下RRF AUC在SFT regime仅0.65（指定范围[0.58,0.70]中值）， 未显著超越最佳单信号，信号间高冗余度使融合收益几乎为零。\\n\",\n256\t    \"results\": {\n257\t      \"rrf_4signal_auc_100pct_dosage\": 0.68,\n258\t      \"rrf_4signal_auc_50pct_dosage\": 0.63,\n259\t      \"rrf_4signal_auc_25pct_dosage\": 0.58,\n260\t      \"rrf_4signal_auc_5pct_dosage\": 0.53,\n261\t      \"rrf_4signal_auc_avg_across_dosages\": 0.65,\n262\t      \"best_single_signal_auc_100pct\": 0.71,\n263\t      \"rrf_vs_best_single_delta_100pct\": -0.03,\n264\t      \"rrf_vs_best_single_delta_avg\": -0.01,\n265\t      \"rank_avg_auc_100pct\": 0.67,\n266\t      \"calibrated_weighted_rrf_auc_100pct\": 0.69,\n267\t      \"degraded_2signal_auc_100pct\": 0.62,\n268\t      \"degraded_2signal_auc_50pct\": 0.57,\n269\t      \"degraded_2signal_vs_4signal_gap\": 0.06,\n270\t      \"fp_injection_auc_drop_10pct\": 0.05,\n271\t      \"fp_injection_auc_drop_20pct\": 0.1,\n272\t      \"signal_corr_matrix_avg_pairwise_r\": 0.55\n273\t    },\n274\t    \"tables\": [\n275\t      {\n276\t        \"name\": \"Table: Aggregation Method Comparison (AUC at 100% dosage, avg across benchmarks)\",\n277\t        \"columns\": [\n278\t          \"method\",\n279\t          \"AUC\",\n280\t          \"Δ vs best single\"\n281\t        ],\n282\t        \"rows\": [\n283\t          [\n284\t            \"Embedding Retrieval (best single)\",\n285\t            0.71,\n286\t            \"—\"\n287\t          ],\n288\t          [\n289\t            \"Min-K%++\",\n290\t            0.66,\n291\t            -0.05\n292\t          ],\n293\t          [\n294\t            \"ConStat\",\n295\t            0.63,\n296\t            -0.08\n297\t          ],\n298\t          [\n299\t            \"Self-Critique\",\n300\t            0.6,\n301\t            -0.11\n302\t          ],\n303\t          [\n304\t            \"RRF (4-signal)\",\n305\t            0.68,\n306\t            -0.03\n307\t          ],\n308\t          [\n309\t            \"Rank Average (4-signal)\",\n310\t            0.67,\n311\t            -0.04\n312\t          ],\n313\t          [\n314\t            \"Weighted RRF (calibrated)\",\n315\t            0.69,\n316\t            -0.02\n317\t          ],\n318\t          [\n319\t            \"2-signal degraded (CS+SC)\",\n320\t            0.62,\n321\t            -0.09\n322\t          ]\n323\t        ]\n324\t      },\n325\t      {\n326\t        \"name\": \"Table: RRF AUC across dosage levels\",\n327\t        \"columns\": [\n328\t          \"method\",\n329\t          \"5%\",\n330\t          \"25%\",\n331\t          \"50%\",\n332\t          \"100%\"\n333\t        ],\n334\t        \"rows\": [\n335\t          [\n336\t            \"RRF 4-signal\",\n337\t            0.53,\n338\t            0.58,\n339\t            0.63,\n340\t            0.68\n341\t          ],\n342\t          [\n343\t            \"Best single (Embedding)\",\n344\t            0.53,\n345\t            0.61,\n346\t            0.67,\n347\t            0.71\n348\t          ],\n349\t          [\n350\t            \"2-signal degraded\",\n351\t            0.51,\n352\t            0.55,\n353\t            0.57,\n354\t            0.62\n355\t          ]\n356\t        ]\n357\t      }\n358\t    ],\n359\t    \"figures\": [],\n360\t    \"analysis\": \"RRF failure不是方法论问题而是信号空间的structural issue：四个信号共享太多variance。 reframed论文中这变为\\\"signal diversity as identifiability prerequisite\\\"的实证证据—— identifiability不仅需要高AUC还需要低inter-signal correlation。 calibrated weighted RRF勉强是最优aggregation（0.69），但改善不显著（p>0.10 vs embedding alone）。 论文中RRF的定位从\\\"methodological contribution\\\"转为\\\"principled default choice with known limitations\\\"。\\n\\n\\nRRF融合在worst档下失败的根本原因是信号冗余： (1) 四个信号pairwise correlation均值0.55，最高(Embedding-MinK++)达0.65—— 它们都在检测同一latent variable（\\\"item exposure\\\"）的不同noisy proxy，proxy之间高度共线性； (2) RRF在100%dosage下0.68反而低于best single signal embedding(0.71)， 因为等权融合中弱信号(Self-Critique 0.60)拖累了整体——RRF的rank-reciprocal weighting 无法有效downweight fundamentally weak signals； (3) Calibrated weighted RRF(0.69)通过data-driven权重略有改善，但改善不显著且不稳定—— 小样本下最优权重的estimation variance吞噬了理论收益； (4) 2-signal degraded mode(ConStat+Self-Critique=0.62)严重不足，这两个恰是四个中最弱的—— closed-weight场景下可用信号恰好是信息量最少的； (5) FP injection高度敏感：20%FP率导致AUC下降0.10，从0.68降至0.58（接近random）， 说明在realistic noise level下RRF极脆弱。\\n\"\n361\t  },\n362\t  {\n363\t    \"name\": \"simulation_identifiability_sweep\",\n364\t    \"description\": \"144条件系统性仿真扫描(6 AUC × 4 N_models × 3 prior × 2 exposure_type)，10 seeds each。 Fisher Information矩阵分析。在worst档下确认identifiability boundary在AUC~0.72， 真实信号(0.65-0.71)系统性落在boundary以下。包含原exp-010(prior sensitivity)和 exp-011(few-examinee regime)的全部内容。Growing Pains pre-estimation子实验。\\n\",\n365\t    \"results\": {\n366\t      \"auc_055_n50_gamma_rmse\": 0.52,\n367\t      \"auc_055_n50_gamma_rel_bias\": 0.65,\n368\t      \"auc_055_n50_theta_corr\": 0.48,\n369\t      \"auc_055_n50_coverage_95\": 0.62,\n370\t      \"auc_060_n50_gamma_rmse\": 0.42,\n371\t      \"auc_060_n50_gamma_rel_bias\": 0.52,\n372\t      \"auc_060_n50_theta_corr\": 0.58,\n373\t      \"auc_060_n50_coverage_95\": 0.68,\n374\t      \"auc_065_n50_gamma_rmse\": 0.31,\n375\t      \"auc_065_n50_gamma_rel_bias\": 0.38,\n376\t      \"auc_065_n50_theta_corr\": 0.7,\n377\t      \"auc_065_n50_coverage_95\": 0.74,\n378\t      \"auc_070_n50_gamma_rmse\": 0.19,\n379\t      \"auc_070_n50_gamma_rel_bias\": 0.22,\n380\t      \"auc_070_n50_theta_corr\": 0.82,\n381\t      \"auc_070_n50_coverage_95\": 0.82,\n382\t      \"auc_080_n50_gamma_rmse\": 0.1,\n383\t      \"auc_080_n50_gamma_rel_bias\": 0.12,\n384\t      \"auc_080_n50_theta_corr\": 0.92,\n385\t      \"auc_080_n50_coverage_95\": 0.91,\n386\t      \"auc_090_n50_gamma_rmse\": 0.06,\n387\t      \"auc_090_n50_gamma_rel_bias\": 0.07,\n388\t      \"auc_090_n50_theta_corr\": 0.96,\n389\t      \"auc_090_n50_coverage_95\": 0.94,\n390\t      \"fisher_info_practical_identifiability_threshold_auc\": 0.72,\n391\t      \"fisher_info_structural_identifiability_holds\": true,\n392\t      \"fisher_info_practical_identifiability_at_065\": false,\n393\t      \"fisher_info_gamma_cramer_rao_bound_at_065\": 0.28,\n394\t      \"fisher_info_gamma_cramer_rao_bound_at_080\": 0.09,\n395\t      \"prior_sensitivity_at_auc_065_mae_range_pp\": 2.8,\n396\t      \"prior_sensitivity_at_auc_080_mae_range_pp\": 0.5,\n397\t      \"prior_sensitivity_index_auc_065\": 0.42,\n398\t      \"prior_sensitivity_index_auc_080\": 0.08,\n399\t      \"prior_n005_gamma_shrinkage_at_065\": 0.48,\n400\t      \"prior_n02_gamma_inflation_at_065\": 1.4,\n401\t      \"n20_auc065_gamma_rmse\": 0.45,\n402\t      \"n20_auc065_gamma_rel_bias\": 0.58,\n403\t      \"n20_auc065_coverage_95\": 0.65,\n404\t      \"n50_auc065_gamma_rmse\": 0.31,\n405\t      \"n50_auc065_coverage_95\": 0.74,\n406\t      \"n100_auc065_gamma_rmse\": 0.22,\n407\t      \"n100_auc065_coverage_95\": 0.78,\n408\t      \"n200_auc065_gamma_rmse\": 0.17,\n409\t      \"n200_auc065_coverage_95\": 0.82,\n410\t      \"growing_pains_pretrain_improvement_n20_pct\": 12,\n411\t      \"growing_pains_pretrain_improvement_n50_pct\": 8,\n412\t      \"minimum_n_for_gamma_significant_at_065\": 120,\n413\t      \"minimum_n_for_coverage_nominal_at_065\": \">200\",\n414\t      \"theta_gamma_posterior_corr_auc_065_n50\": 0.58,\n415\t      \"theta_gamma_posterior_corr_auc_070_n50\": 0.42,\n416\t      \"theta_gamma_posterior_corr_auc_080_n50\": 0.25,\n417\t      \"binary_vs_continuous_mae_gap_at_065\": 1.2,\n418\t      \"continuous_exposure_improves_at_high_auc\": true,\n419\t      \"continuous_exposure_hurts_at_low_auc\": true\n420\t    },\n421\t    \"tables\": [\n422\t      {\n423\t        \"name\": \"Table: Identifiability Map — γ Recovery Metrics by AUC × N_models (default prior N(0,1))\",\n424\t        \"columns\": [\n425\t          \"AUC\",\n426\t          \"N_models\",\n427\t          \"gamma_RMSE\",\n428\t          \"gamma_rel_bias\",\n429\t          \"theta_corr\",\n430\t          \"coverage_95%\",\n431\t          \"CI_width_pp\"\n432\t        ],\n433\t        \"rows\": [\n434\t          [\n435\t            0.55,\n436\t            50,\n437\t            0.52,\n438\t            \"65%\",\n439\t            0.48,\n440\t            \"62%\",\n441\t            32.0\n442\t          ],\n443\t          [\n444\t            0.6,\n445\t            50,\n446\t            0.42,\n447\t            \"52%\",\n448\t            0.58,\n449\t            \"68%\",\n450\t            26.5\n451\t          ],\n452\t          [\n453\t            0.65,\n454\t            50,\n455\t            0.31,\n456\t            \"38%\",\n457\t            0.7,\n458\t            \"74%\",\n459\t            21.0\n460\t          ],\n461\t          [\n462\t            0.7,\n463\t            50,\n464\t            0.19,\n465\t            \"22%\",\n466\t            0.82,\n467\t            \"82%\",\n468\t            14.5\n469\t          ],\n470\t          [\n471\t            0.8,\n472\t            50,\n473\t            0.1,\n474\t            \"12%\",\n475\t            0.92,\n476\t            \"91%\",\n477\t            8.2\n478\t          ],\n479\t          [\n480\t            0.9,\n481\t            50,\n482\t            0.06,\n483\t            \"7%\",\n484\t            0.96,\n485\t            \"94%\",\n486\t            5.1\n487\t          ],\n488\t          [\n489\t            0.65,\n490\t            20,\n491\t            0.45,\n492\t            \"58%\",\n493\t            0.52,\n494\t            \"65%\",\n495\t            28.5\n496\t          ],\n497\t          [\n498\t            0.65,\n499\t            100,\n500\t            0.22,\n501\t            \"28%\",\n502\t            0.78,\n503\t            \"78%\",\n504\t            16.8\n505\t          ],\n506\t          [\n507\t            0.65,\n508\t            200,\n509\t            0.17,\n510\t            \"21%\",\n511\t            0.84,\n512\t            \"82%\",\n513\t            13.5\n514\t          ]\n515\t        ]\n516\t      },\n517\t      {\n518\t        \"name\": \"Table: Prior Sensitivity by AUC Level\",\n519\t        \"columns\": [\n520\t          \"AUC\",\n521\t          \"prior N(0,0.5) MAE\",\n522\t          \"prior N(0,1) MAE\",\n523\t          \"prior N(0,2) MAE\",\n524\t          \"sensitivity_index\"\n525\t        ],\n526\t        \"rows\": [\n527\t          [\n528\t            0.55,\n529\t            12.5,\n530\t            10.8,\n531\t            9.5,\n532\t            0.58\n533\t          ],\n534\t          [\n535\t            0.65,\n536\t            9.0,\n537\t            7.5,\n538\t            6.2,\n539\t            0.42\n540\t          ],\n541\t          [\n542\t            0.7,\n543\t            5.2,\n544\t            4.8,\n545\t            4.5,\n546\t            0.15\n547\t          ],\n548\t          [\n549\t            0.8,\n550\t            2.8,\n551\t            2.6,\n552\t            2.5,\n553\t            0.08\n554\t          ]\n555\t        ]\n556\t      },\n557\t      {\n558\t        \"name\": \"Table: Fisher Information — Cramér-Rao Bounds for γ\",\n559\t        \"columns\": [\n560\t          \"AUC\",\n561\t          \"CR bound (sd)\",\n562\t          \"practical identifiable?\",\n563\t          \"min N for γ sig\"\n564\t        ],\n565\t        \"rows\": [\n566\t          [\n567\t            0.55,\n568\t            0.45,\n569\t            \"No\",\n570\t            \">500\"\n571\t          ],\n572\t          [\n573\t            0.6,\n574\t            0.35,\n575\t            \"No\",\n576\t            \">300\"\n577\t          ],\n578\t          [\n579\t            0.65,\n580\t            0.28,\n581\t            \"No\",\n582\t            \">120\"\n583\t          ],\n584\t          [\n585\t            0.7,\n586\t            0.15,\n587\t            \"Marginal\",\n588\t            \"~60\"\n589\t          ],\n590\t          [\n591\t            0.8,\n592\t            0.09,\n593\t            \"Yes\",\n594\t            \"~30\"\n595\t          ],\n596\t          [\n597\t            0.9,\n598\t            0.05,\n599\t            \"Yes\",\n600\t            \"~15\"\n601\t          ]\n602\t        ]\n603\t      }\n604\t    ],\n605\t    \"figures\": [],\n606\t    \"analysis\": \"这是reframed论文的理论核心。三个层次的贡献： (1) Structural vs practical identifiability的formal distinction——首次在contamination calibration 语境中给出，Fisher Information分析提供了interpretable的AUC threshold（0.72）； (2) Phase transition at AUC~0.70-0.72——不是smooth degradation而是sharp boundary， 这个发现具有prescriptive value：未来的detection signal研究需要以0.72 AUC为minimum target； (3) Prior sensitivity作为under-identification的diagnostic——sensitivity index > 0.30 意味着Bayesian方法的结果本质上由prior而非data决定，这是一个general-purpose diagnostic。 真实信号AUC(0.65-0.71)恰好落在phase transition边界上，解释了所有下游实验的failure mode。\\n\\n\\n144-condition sweep产生的identifiability map是worst档论文的核心理论贡献： (1) Fisher Information分析给出structural identifiability始终成立（γ理论上可由数据唯一确定）， 但practical identifiability在AUC<0.72时崩溃——Cramér-Rao lower bound在AUC=0.65时为0.28， 意味着γ的理论最小标准差已经是0.28（在γ_true=0.50时），任何estimator都无法做到更好； (2) AUC=0.65→0.70是critical transition zone：RMSE从0.31骤降至0.19，coverage从74%跳至82%， θ-γ corr从0.58降至0.42——这不是smooth degradation而是phase transition， 在0.70以下parameters本质上confounded，在0.70以上开始separable； (3) Prior sensitivity在AUC<0.70时剧烈（index 0.42，MAE range 2.8pp）， 说明在低信号质量下结果由modeler's prior choice而非data驱动—— N(0,0.5)将γ shrink 48%，N(0,2)将γ inflate 40%，且对应MAE差异达2.8pp； (4) Few-examinee regime与AUC形成multiplicative interaction：N=20×AUC=0.65时 RMSE=0.45/rel_bias=58%，estimation本质上是noise；即使N=200×AUC=0.65， coverage仍仅82%（未达nominal 95%），且需要>200 models才能让γ显著—— 但现实中绝大多数benchmark evaluation不超过100 models； (5) Binary vs continuous exposure：低AUC下continuous exposure反而更差（+1.2pp MAE）， 因为continuous exposure引入了额外estimation noise维度，而binary虽然粗糙但variance更低。\\n\"\n607\t  },\n608\t  {\n609\t    \"name\": \"noise_propagation_analysis\",\n610\t    \"description\": \"噪声传播分析。worst档下measurement error model收敛但产生vacuously wide CIs（>20pp）， 使calibration在实用意义上失去价值——CI覆盖名义上达标但宽度trivially覆盖一切。\\n\",\n611\t    \"results\": {\n612\t      \"baseline_gamma_ci_width_pp\": 9.5,\n613\t      \"noise_1x_gamma_ci_width_pp\": 14.8,\n614\t      \"noise_1_5x_gamma_ci_width_pp\": 19.5,\n615\t      \"noise_2x_gamma_ci_width_pp\": 26.0,\n616\t      \"baseline_theta_ci_width_pp\": 7.2,\n617\t      \"noise_1x_theta_ci_width_pp\": 11.5,\n618\t      \"noise_1_5x_theta_ci_width_pp\": 15.8,\n619\t      \"noise_2x_theta_ci_width_pp\": 21.5,\n620\t      \"ci_coverage_95_baseline\": 0.76,\n621\t      \"ci_coverage_95_noise_1x\": 0.84,\n622\t      \"ci_coverage_95_noise_1_5x\": 0.91,\n623\t      \"ci_coverage_95_noise_2x\": 0.96,\n624\t      \"measurement_error_model_converged\": true,\n625\t      \"measurement_error_model_gamma_ci_width_pp\": 22.0,\n626\t      \"measurement_error_model_theta_ci_width_pp\": 15.5,\n627\t      \"measurement_error_model_coverage_95\": 0.92,\n628\t      \"measurement_error_model_coverage_80\": 0.78,\n629\t      \"ci_width_exceeds_15pp_pct\": 0.72,\n630\t      \"ci_width_exceeds_20pp_pct\": 0.58,\n631\t      \"selfcritique_estimated_fp_rate\": 0.38,\n632\t      \"selfcritique_estimated_fn_rate\": 0.3,\n633\t      \"embedding_estimated_fp_rate\": 0.22,\n634\t      \"embedding_estimated_fn_rate\": 0.18\n635\t    },\n636\t    \"tables\": [\n637\t      {\n638\t        \"name\": \"Table: CI Width and Coverage under Noise Injection and Measurement Error Model\",\n639\t        \"columns\": [\n640\t          \"noise_level\",\n641\t          \"gamma_ci_width_pp\",\n642\t          \"theta_ci_width_pp\",\n643\t          \"coverage_95%\",\n644\t          \"coverage_80%\"\n645\t        ],\n646\t        \"rows\": [\n647\t          [\n648\t            \"baseline (0x)\",\n649\t            9.5,\n650\t            7.2,\n651\t            0.76,\n652\t            0.58\n653\t          ],\n654\t          [\n655\t            \"matched (1x)\",\n656\t            14.8,\n657\t            11.5,\n658\t            0.84,\n659\t            0.68\n660\t          ],\n661\t          [\n662\t            \"1.5x\",\n663\t            19.5,\n664\t            15.8,\n665\t            0.91,\n666\t            0.78\n667\t          ],\n668\t          [\n669\t            \"2x\",\n670\t            26.0,\n671\t            21.5,\n672\t            0.96,\n673\t            0.88\n674\t          ],\n675\t          [\n676\t            \"measurement error model\",\n677\t            22.0,\n678\t            15.5,\n679\t            0.92,\n680\t            0.78\n681\t          ]\n682\t        ]\n683\t      }\n684\t    ],\n685\t    \"figures\": [],\n686\t    \"analysis\": \"这是worst档最具诊断价值的实验。核心发现可formalize为noise amplification inequality： 当detection signal AUC < 0.70时，IRT模型的measurement error propagation使CI width 超过practical utility threshold（~15pp），且calibration退化为vacuous uncertainty statement。 reframed论文贡献：将identifiability boundary从binary（\\\"能否估计γ\\\"）升级为graded （\\\"估计的γ是否产生actionable calibration\\\"），引入practical identifiability的operational定义。 关键：measurement error model\\\"修复\\\"了coverage（从0.76→0.92）但代价是width（从9.5→22pp）， 这不是bug而是feature——它诚实地报告了\\\"在当前信号质量下我们无法做精确calibration\\\"。\\n\\n\\nnoise propagation在worst档下揭示了precision-coverage的fundamental tradeoff： (1) 基线CI width已是9.5pp（因信号AUC低致γ posterior宽），加上matched noise后膨胀至14.8pp， 1.5x noise达19.5pp——此时一个60%准确率模型的95%CI覆盖[40.2%, 79.8%]，无法做有意义的model selection； (2) Coverage随noise增加从0.76升至0.96——这是overcoverage，不是calibration改善， 是CI变宽到trivially覆盖一切的artifact； (3) Measurement error model收敛但CI width 22pp（>20pp threshold），92%的coverage 看似接近nominal 95%，但代价是58%的conditions下CI宽度超过20pp—— 等价于声明\\\"真实score在40%-80%之间\\\"，这是technically correct but practically vacuous的结论； (4) Self-Critique的FP=38%/FN=30%意味着matched noise level极高—— 接近1/3的标注是错的，这不是calibration能解决的信号质量问题； (5) 即使用最好的信号embedding（FP=22%/FN=18%），measurement error model的CI仍然>18pp， 因为noise propagation是amplifying而非absorbing——低AUC + noise propagation = 信息损失放大。\\n\"\n687\t  },\n688\t  {\n689\t    \"name\": \"irt_calibration_and_baselines\",\n690\t    \"description\": \"核心calibration实验——4PL+γ IRT两个variant（global γ, per-benchmark γ_k）+ 7 baselines（含DCR）。 worst档下4PL+γ不显著优于简单baselines，DCR在部分benchmark上更优或comparable， per-benchmark γ_k要么不收敛要么与global γ无统计差异。\\n\",\n691\t    \"results\": {\n692\t      \"calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_global_pp\": 6.8,\n693\t      \"calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_global_mmlu_pp\": 5.2,\n694\t      \"calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_global_gsm8k_pp\": 8.5,\n695\t      \"calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_global_arc_pp\": 6.2,\n696\t      \"calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_global_humaneval_pp\": 7.3,\n697\t      \"ci_coverage_95_global\": 0.76,\n698\t      \"ci_coverage_80_global\": 0.58,\n699\t      \"ci_coverage_50_global\": 0.35,\n700\t      \"ci_width_95_avg_pp\": 9.5,\n701\t      \"kendall_tau_global\": 0.72,\n702\t      \"dose_response_spearman\": 0.58,\n703\t      \"dose_response_monotonic\": false,\n704\t      \"dose_response_5pct_gamma_ci_includes_zero\": true,\n705\t      \"dose_response_25pct_gamma_ci_includes_zero\": true,\n706\t      \"dose_response_50pct_gamma_ci_includes_zero\": false,\n707\t      \"dose_response_100pct_gamma_significant\": true,\n708\t      \"gamma_posterior_mean_global\": 0.34,\n709\t      \"gamma_theta_posterior_corr\": 0.63,\n710\t      \"gamma_rel_bias_avg\": 0.32,\n711\t      \"per_benchmark_gamma_k_mmlu_mean\": 0.42,\n712\t      \"per_benchmark_gamma_k_gsm8k_mean\": 0.18,\n713\t      \"per_benchmark_gamma_k_arc_mean\": 0.35,\n714\t      \"per_benchmark_gamma_k_humaneval_ess\": 85,\n715\t      \"per_benchmark_gamma_k_humaneval_rhat\": 1.12,\n716\t      \"per_benchmark_gamma_k_humaneval_converged\": false,\n717\t      \"per_benchmark_gamma_k_vs_global_overlap_pct\": 0.78,\n718\t      \"per_benchmark_gamma_k_significantly_different\": false,\n719\t      \"per_benchmark_gamma_k_mae_pp\": 6.5,\n720\t      \"per_benchmark_gamma_k_mae_vs_global_improvement_pp\": 0.3,\n721\t      \"calibration_mae_raw_pp\": 8.5,\n722\t      \"calibration_mae_remove_rescore_pp\": 7.2,\n723\t      \"calibration_mae_single_2pl_gamma_pp\": 6.5,\n724\t      \"calibration_mae_vanilla_4pl_pp\": 8.8,\n725\t      \"calibration_mae_linear_regression_pp\": 6.2,\n726\t      \"calibration_mae_emperor_pp\": 8.0,\n727\t      \"calibration_mae_dcr_pp\": 6.4,\n728\t      \"dcr_mae_mmlu_pp\": 5.0,\n729\t      \"dcr_mae_gsm8k_pp\": 7.8,\n730\t      \"dcr_mae_arc_pp\": 5.8,\n731\t      \"dcr_mae_humaneval_pp\": 7.0,\n732\t      \"dcr_beats_contam_cal_on_benchmarks\": [\n733\t        \"MMLU\",\n734\t        \"ARC-C\"\n735\t      ],\n736\t      \"dcr_provides_uncertainty\": false,\n737\t      \"paired_ttest_4pl_vs_linear_pvalue\": 0.18,\n738\t      \"paired_ttest_4pl_vs_dcr_pvalue\": 0.35,\n739\t      \"paired_ttest_4pl_vs_single_2pl_pvalue\": 0.42,\n740\t      \"paired_ttest_4pl_vs_remove_rescore_pvalue\": 0.08,\n741\t      \"paired_ttest_4pl_vs_emperor_pvalue\": 0.04,\n742\t      \"paired_ttest_4pl_vs_vanilla_4pl_pvalue\": 0.02,\n743\t      \"baselines_significantly_beaten_count\": 2,\n744\t      \"stan_rhat_max_global\": 1.06,\n745\t      \"stan_divergent_pct_global\": 2.8,\n746\t      \"stan_ess_min_global\": 210,\n747\t      \"ppc_residual_corr_mean\": 0.12,\n748\t      \"ppc_residual_corr_exceeds_005_pct\": 0.35\n749\t    },\n750\t    \"tables\": [\n751\t      {\n752\t        \"name\": \"Table: Calibration MAE (pp) by Method × Benchmark (mean ± std across 3 seeds)\",\n753\t        \"columns\": [\n754\t          \"method\",\n755\t          \"MMLU\",\n756\t          \"GSM8K\",\n757\t          \"ARC-C\",\n758\t          \"HumanEval\",\n759\t          \"Average\"\n760\t        ],\n761\t        \"rows\": [\n762\t          [\n763\t            \"4PL+γ global (ours)\",\n764\t            \"5.2±0.8\",\n765\t            \"8.5±1.5\",\n766\t            \"6.2±1.0\",\n767\t            \"7.3±1.8\",\n768\t            \"6.8±1.1\"\n769\t          ],\n770\t          [\n771\t            \"4PL+γ_k per-benchmark\",\n772\t            \"5.0±0.9\",\n773\t            \"8.2±1.6\",\n774\t            \"5.9±1.1\",\n775\t            \"7.0±2.2\",\n776\t            \"6.5±1.2\"\n777\t          ],\n778\t          [\n779\t            \"Raw (no adjustment)\",\n780\t            8.5,\n781\t            7.8,\n782\t            8.2,\n783\t            9.5,\n784\t            8.5\n785\t          ],\n786\t          [\n787\t            \"Remove-and-rescore\",\n788\t            6.5,\n789\t            7.8,\n790\t            6.8,\n791\t            7.7,\n792\t            7.2\n793\t          ],\n794\t          [\n795\t            \"Single-signal 2PL+γ\",\n796\t            5.5,\n797\t            7.5,\n798\t            5.8,\n799\t            7.2,\n800\t            6.5\n801\t          ],\n802\t          [\n803\t            \"Vanilla 4PL (no γ)\",\n804\t            8.0,\n805\t            9.5,\n806\t            8.2,\n807\t            9.5,\n808\t            8.8\n809\t          ],\n810\t          [\n811\t            \"Linear regression+CI\",\n812\t            5.0,\n813\t            7.2,\n814\t            5.5,\n815\t            7.1,\n816\t            6.2\n817\t          ],\n818\t          [\n819\t            \"Emperor mitigation\",\n820\t            7.2,\n821\t            8.8,\n822\t            7.5,\n823\t            8.5,\n824\t            8.0\n825\t          ],\n826\t          [\n827\t            \"DCR (EMNLP 2025)\",\n828\t            5.0,\n829\t            7.8,\n830\t            5.8,\n831\t            7.0,\n832\t            6.4\n833\t          ]\n834\t        ]\n835\t      },\n836\t      {\n837\t        \"name\": \"Table: Interval Quality Metrics (4PL+γ global)\",\n838\t        \"columns\": [\n839\t          \"metric\",\n840\t          \"MMLU\",\n841\t          \"GSM8K\",\n842\t          \"ARC-C\",\n843\t          \"HumanEval\",\n844\t          \"Average\"\n845\t        ],\n846\t        \"rows\": [\n847\t          [\n848\t            \"Coverage 95%\",\n849\t            0.8,\n850\t            0.72,\n851\t            0.78,\n852\t            0.74,\n853\t            0.76\n854\t          ],\n855\t          [\n856\t            \"Coverage 80%\",\n857\t            0.62,\n858\t            0.52,\n859\t            0.6,\n860\t            0.56,\n861\t            0.58\n862\t          ],\n863\t          [\n864\t            \"Coverage 50%\",\n865\t            0.38,\n866\t            0.3,\n867\t            0.36,\n868\t            0.34,\n869\t            0.35\n870\t          ],\n871\t          [\n872\t            \"CI width 95% (pp)\",\n873\t            8.2,\n874\t            11.5,\n875\t            9.0,\n876\t            9.2,\n877\t            9.5\n878\t          ],\n879\t          [\n880\t            \"Kendall τ\",\n881\t            0.78,\n882\t            0.65,\n883\t            0.75,\n884\t            0.68,\n885\t            0.72\n886\t          ]\n887\t        ]\n888\t      },\n889\t      {\n890\t        \"name\": \"Table: Dose-Response γ Estimates (global γ, MMLU)\",\n891\t        \"columns\": [\n892\t          \"dosage\",\n893\t          \"gamma_mean\",\n894\t          \"gamma_95ci_lower\",\n895\t          \"gamma_95ci_upper\",\n896\t          \"ci_excludes_zero\"\n897\t        ],\n898\t        \"rows\": [\n899\t          [\n900\t            \"5%\",\n901\t            0.05,\n902\t            -0.22,\n903\t            0.32,\n904\t            false\n905\t          ],\n906\t          [\n907\t            \"25%\",\n908\t            0.13,\n909\t            -0.1,\n910\t            0.36,\n911\t            false\n912\t          ],\n913\t          [\n914\t            \"50%\",\n915\t            0.26,\n916\t            0.02,\n917\t            0.5,\n918\t            true\n919\t          ],\n920\t          [\n921\t            \"100%\",\n922\t            0.42,\n923\t            0.14,\n924\t            0.7,\n925\t            true\n926\t          ]\n927\t        ]\n928\t      },\n929\t      {\n930\t        \"name\": \"Table: Per-benchmark γ_k vs Global γ\",\n931\t        \"columns\": [\n932\t          \"benchmark\",\n933\t          \"γ_k mean\",\n934\t          \"γ_k 95%CI\",\n935\t          \"global γ 95%CI\",\n936\t          \"overlap_pct\",\n937\t          \"converged\"\n938\t        ],\n939\t        \"rows\": [\n940\t          [\n941\t            \"MMLU\",\n942\t            0.42,\n943\t            \"[0.12, 0.72]\",\n944\t            \"[0.10, 0.58]\",\n945\t            \"72%\",\n946\t            true\n947\t          ],\n948\t          [\n949\t            \"GSM8K\",\n950\t            0.18,\n951\t            \"[-0.15, 0.51]\",\n952\t            \"[0.10, 0.58]\",\n953\t            \"85%\",\n954\t            true\n955\t          ],\n956\t          [\n957\t            \"ARC-C\",\n958\t            0.35,\n959\t            \"[0.02, 0.68]\",\n960\t            \"[0.10, 0.58]\",\n961\t            \"78%\",\n962\t            true\n963\t          ],\n964\t          [\n965\t            \"HumanEval\",\n966\t            0.28,\n967\t            \"[-0.30, 0.86]\",\n968\t            \"[0.10, 0.58]\",\n969\t            \"80%\",\n970\t            \"No (ESS=85)\"\n971\t          ]\n972\t        ]\n973\t      }\n974\t    ],\n975\t    \"figures\": [],\n976\t    \"analysis\": \"calibration claim的formal death certificate： (1) 4PL+γ不优于linear regression（p=0.18）——IRT的复杂参数化（a,b,c,d,γ五参数/item） 在当前信号质量和sample size下是over-parameterized，额外complexity被estimation noise吞噬； (2) DCR comparable（p=0.35）且在MMLU/ARC上更好——existing method已经做到comparable甚至更好的 point estimation，ContamCal唯一的theoretical advantage（Bayesian UQ）因CI太宽而无practical value； (3) Per-benchmark γ_k是methodological improvement but empirically vacuous—— 没有足够statistical power区分benchmark effects，HumanEval甚至不收敛； (4) Dose-response非单调 + γ-θ corr=0.63 = additive γ model misspecified + confounded。 Reframed论文角度：这些结果精确match了exp-004的identifiability boundary prediction—— 真实AUC(0.65-0.71)落在phase transition zone，构成\\\"theory-practice alignment\\\"的核心evidence。 DCR的同样mediocre performance可以作为supporting evidence：\\\"不只是ContamCal fail—— 问题本身在当前信号下intractable for any method。\\\"\\n\\n\\n这是worst档calibration claim崩溃的核心实验，多条证据同时指向failure： (1) 4PL+γ global MAE 6.8pp——落在worst档范围[4.5,9.0]中部，看似不糟糕但context matters： linear regression以6.2pp击败它，DCR以6.4pp与其comparable——更复杂的模型反而不如更简单的替代； (2) γ-θ posterior correlation 0.63（>0.6 threshold），confirm identifiability breached—— 模型混淆了\\\"高能力\\\"和\\\"被contaminate\\\"，posterior呈banana/ridge shape导致sampling困难 （2.8% divergences, ESS仅210, R-hat 1.06边缘）； (3) Dose-response非单调：5%和25%的γ CI包含零，仅50%和100%显著—— Spearman仅0.58（远低于monotonic的0.95+），因为低dosage的non-detectable inflation 加上estimation noise产生了random-walk-like的γ path； (4) Per-benchmark γ_k结果disappointing：MMLU γ_k=0.42 vs GSM8K γ_k=0.18—— 方向正确（MMLU inflation确实更高）但HumanEval不收敛（ESS=85, R-hat=1.12， 因为N=164 items对4PL+γ的参数量不足）； γ_k的95%CI之间78%重叠，Wald test显示与global γ无统计差异—— 没有足够power区分benchmark-specific effects； (5) DCR在MMLU和ARC-C上MAE更低（5.0pp/5.8pp vs 5.2pp/6.2pp）， 尽管DCR不提供uncertainty bounds——这是worst档最尴尬的结果之一： 唯一的existing method在point estimation上comparable甚至更好， 而ContamCal的uncertainty advantage因CI太宽（9.5pp）而没有practical value； (6) 仅2个baselines被显著击败（vanilla 4PL和Emperor mitigation）， 但这是低门槛——vanilla 4PL完全忽略contamination，Emperor是已知失败的mitigation。 Coverage 76%严重undercoverage（nominal 95%），且posterior predictive checks显示 35%的item pairs有超过0.05的residual correlation，暗示local independence violation。\\n\"\n977\t  },\n978\t  {\n979\t    \"name\": \"scale_bridging_7b\",\n980\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B 5个dosage levels的controlled SFT。worst档下scale-up加剧γ-θ confounding—— 更大模型的inflation更小但signal更弱，calibration difficulty与scale正相关。\\n\",\n981\t    \"results\": {\n982\t      \"sft_runs_completed\": 5,\n983\t      \"mmlu_inflation_100pct_pp\": 4.2,\n984\t      \"mmlu_inflation_50pct_pp\": 2.5,\n985\t      \"mmlu_inflation_5pct_pp\": 0.3,\n986\t      \"gsm8k_inflation_100pct_pp\": 2.6,\n987\t      \"signal_auc_embedding_100pct\": 0.64,\n988\t      \"signal_auc_minkpp_100pct\": 0.6,\n989\t      \"signal_auc_rrf_100pct\": 0.62,\n990\t      \"gamma_estimate_100pct\": 0.22,\n991\t      \"gamma_ci_includes_zero_100pct\": false,\n992\t      \"gamma_ci_includes_zero_50pct\": true,\n993\t      \"calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp\": 8.2,\n994\t      \"calibration_mae_linear_regression_pp\": 7.5,\n995\t      \"calibration_mae_dcr_pp\": 7.0,\n996\t      \"gamma_theta_posterior_corr\": 0.68,\n997\t      \"ci_width_95_pp\": 11.5,\n998\t      \"ci_coverage_95\": 0.73,\n999\t      \"kendall_tau\": 0.68,\n1000\t      \"inflation_vs_3b_ratio\": 0.49\n1001\t    },\n1002\t    \"tables\": [\n1003\t      {\n1004\t        \"name\": \"Table: 7B vs Smaller Models at 100% Dosage\",\n1005\t        \"columns\": [\n1006\t          \"metric\",\n1007\t          \"Qwen-0.5B\",\n1008\t          \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n1009\t          \"Qwen-3B\",\n1010\t          \"Qwen-7B\"\n1011\t        ],\n1012\t        \"rows\": [\n1013\t          [\n1014\t            \"MMLU inflation (pp)\",\n1015\t            11.8,\n1016\t            7.4,\n1017\t            5.5,\n1018\t            4.2\n1019\t          ],\n1020\t          [\n1021\t            \"Embedding AUC\",\n1022\t            0.74,\n1023\t            0.72,\n1024\t            0.67,\n1025\t            0.64\n1026\t          ],\n1027\t          [\n1028\t            \"RRF AUC\",\n1029\t            0.7,\n1030\t            0.68,\n1031\t            0.65,\n1032\t            0.62\n1033\t          ],\n1034\t          [\n1035\t            \"γ estimate\",\n1036\t            0.45,\n1037\t            0.4,\n1038\t            0.34,\n1039\t            0.22\n1040\t          ],\n1041\t          [\n1042\t            \"γ-θ posterior corr\",\n1043\t            0.55,\n1044\t            0.58,\n1045\t            0.63,\n1046\t            0.68\n1047\t          ],\n1048\t          [\n1049\t            \"Calibration MAE (pp)\",\n1050\t            5.8,\n1051\t            6.2,\n1052\t            6.8,\n1053\t            8.2\n1054\t          ],\n1055\t          [\n1056\t            \"CI width 95% (pp)\",\n1057\t            7.5,\n1058\t            8.2,\n1059\t            9.5,\n1060\t            11.5\n1061\t          ]\n1062\t        ]\n1063\t      }\n1064\t    ],\n1065\t    \"figures\": [],\n1066\t    \"analysis\": \"7B实验提供了worst档最重要的scaling insight：calibration difficulty与model scale正相关。 这不是方法论failure而是problem structure的fundamental property—— \\\"the models most in need of calibration (large, highly capable) are precisely those where calibration is least feasible\\\"。 对reframed论文：identifiability map获得了第三个维度（signal quality × model count × model scale）， 且scale维度是最novel的——prior identifiability分析未考虑\\\"ability confounds detection\\\"。\\n\\n\\n7B在worst档下表现更差而非更好，揭示了一个fundamental scaling property： (1) Inflation仅4.2pp at 100%（vs 0.5B的11.8pp）——7B的pretraining knowledge已经广泛 覆盖benchmark content，SFT的边际memorization效应递减。5%dosage的0.3pp inflation 完全不可检测（<1/3个standard deviation）； (2) Signal AUC从3B的0.67降至0.64（embedding）——更大模型\\\"naturally knowing the answer\\\" 混淆了contamination signal，detection不再是\\\"did the model see this item\\\" 而是\\\"does the model's knowledge of this item come from pre-training or SFT\\\"—— 后者是一个fundamentally harder问题； (3) γ-θ posterior correlation升至0.68（最高）——7B是最capable的model， ability和contamination的confounding最严重。posterior banana shape更pronounced， 导致更多sampling difficulty（divergences likely >3%）； (4) DCR在7B上MAE 7.0pp，优于4PL+γ的8.2pp——DCR的simpler contamination model 在larger model scale上反而更robust因为它不尝试disentangle ability from contamination； (5) CI width 11.5pp + coverage 73% = simultaneously too wide AND undercovering—— 这说明不仅估计不精确（wide），还misspecified（poor coverage despite width）。\\n\"\n1067\t  },\n1068\t  {\n1069\t    \"name\": \"signal_survival_analysis\",\n1070\t    \"description\": \"Signal × regime AUC heatmap：4 signals × {base, SFT-clean, SFT-contam, RL}。 worst档下关键假设\\\"cliff-like degradation under RL\\\"不成立—— degradation是gradual且benchmark-dependent的，无清晰regime boundary。\\n\",\n1071\t    \"results\": {\n1072\t      \"auc_heatmap\": {\n1073\t        \"base_embedding\": 0.76,\n1074\t        \"base_minkpp\": 0.72,\n1075\t        \"base_constat\": 0.69,\n1076\t        \"base_selfcritique\": 0.58,\n1077\t        \"sft_clean_embedding\": 0.7,\n1078\t        \"sft_clean_minkpp\": 0.64,\n1079\t        \"sft_clean_constat\": 0.61,\n1080\t        \"sft_clean_selfcritique\": 0.56,\n1081\t        \"sft_contam_embedding\": 0.71,\n1082\t        \"sft_contam_minkpp\": 0.66,\n1083\t        \"sft_contam_constat\": 0.63,\n1084\t        \"sft_contam_selfcritique\": 0.6,\n1085\t        \"rl_embedding\": 0.58,\n1086\t        \"rl_minkpp\": 0.52,\n1087\t        \"rl_constat\": 0.5,\n1088\t        \"rl_selfcritique\": 0.54\n1089\t      },\n1090\t      \"signal_survival_rate_sft_avg\": 0.9,\n1091\t      \"signal_survival_rate_rl_avg\": 0.74,\n1092\t      \"rl_best_signal\": \"selfcritique\",\n1093\t      \"rl_best_signal_auc\": 0.54,\n1094\t      \"rl_all_signals_below_060\": true,\n1095\t      \"sft_clean_vs_contam_auc_diff_avg\": 0.02,\n1096\t      \"regime_effect_anova_pvalue\": 0.008,\n1097\t      \"cliff_test_sft_to_rl_is_cliff\": false,\n1098\t      \"cliff_test_gradual_slope\": -0.035,\n1099\t      \"benchmark_specific_signal_ordering_changes\": true,\n1100\t      \"mmlu_best_rl_signal\": \"embedding\",\n1101\t      \"mmlu_rl_embedding_auc\": 0.6,\n1102\t      \"gsm8k_best_rl_signal\": \"selfcritique\",\n1103\t      \"gsm8k_rl_selfcritique_auc\": 0.56,\n1104\t      \"humaneval_best_rl_signal\": \"constat\",\n1105\t      \"humaneval_rl_constat_auc\": 0.53\n1106\t    },\n1107\t    \"tables\": [\n1108\t      {\n1109\t        \"name\": \"Table: Signal × Regime AUC Heatmap\",\n1110\t        \"columns\": [\n1111\t          \"signal\",\n1112\t          \"Base\",\n1113\t          \"SFT-Clean\",\n1114\t          \"SFT-Contam\",\n1115\t          \"RL\"\n1116\t        ],\n1117\t        \"rows\": [\n1118\t          [\n1119\t            \"Embedding Retrieval\",\n1120\t            0.76,\n1121\t            0.7,\n1122\t            0.71,\n1123\t            0.58\n1124\t          ],\n1125\t          [\n1126\t            \"Min-K%++\",\n1127\t            0.72,\n1128\t            0.64,\n1129\t            0.66,\n1130\t            0.52\n1131\t          ],\n1132\t          [\n1133\t            \"ConStat\",\n1134\t            0.69,\n1135\t            0.61,\n1136\t            0.63,\n1137\t            0.5\n1138\t          ],\n1139\t          [\n1140\t            \"Self-Critique\",\n1141\t            0.58,\n1142\t            0.56,\n1143\t            0.6,\n1144\t            0.54\n1145\t          ]\n1146\t        ]\n1147\t      },\n1148\t      {\n1149\t        \"name\": \"Table: Signal Survival Rate (AUC retention relative to Base)\",\n1150\t        \"columns\": [\n1151\t          \"signal\",\n1152\t          \"SFT-Clean\",\n1153\t          \"SFT-Contam\",\n1154\t          \"RL\"\n1155\t        ],\n1156\t        \"rows\": [\n1157\t          [\n1158\t            \"Embedding Retrieval\",\n1159\t            0.92,\n1160\t            0.93,\n1161\t            0.76\n1162\t          ],\n1163\t          [\n1164\t            \"Min-K%++\",\n1165\t            0.89,\n1166\t            0.92,\n1167\t            0.72\n1168\t          ],\n1169\t          [\n1170\t            \"ConStat\",\n1171\t            0.88,\n1172\t            0.91,\n1173\t            0.72\n1174\t          ],\n1175\t          [\n1176\t            \"Self-Critique\",\n1177\t            0.97,\n1178\t            1.03,\n1179\t            0.93\n1180\t          ]\n1181\t        ]\n1182\t      },\n1183\t      {\n1184\t        \"name\": \"Table: Best Signal by Regime × Benchmark (AUC)\",\n1185\t        \"columns\": [\n1186\t          \"benchmark\",\n1187\t          \"SFT-best\",\n1188\t          \"SFT-AUC\",\n1189\t          \"RL-best\",\n1190\t          \"RL-AUC\"\n1191\t        ],\n1192\t        \"rows\": [\n1193\t          [\n1194\t            \"MMLU\",\n1195\t            \"Embedding\",\n1196\t            0.74,\n1197\t            \"Embedding\",\n1198\t            0.6\n1199\t          ],\n1200\t          [\n1201\t            \"GSM8K\",\n1202\t            \"Min-K++\",\n1203\t            0.65,\n1204\t            \"Self-Critique\",\n1205\t            0.56\n1206\t          ],\n1207\t          [\n1208\t            \"ARC-C\",\n1209\t            \"Embedding\",\n1210\t            0.7,\n1211\t            \"Self-Critique\",\n1212\t            0.55\n1213\t          ],\n1214\t          [\n1215\t            \"HumanEval\",\n1216\t            \"Embedding\",\n1217\t            0.72,\n1218\t            \"ConStat\",\n1219\t            0.53\n1220\t          ]\n1221\t        ]\n1222\t      }\n1223\t    ],\n1224\t    \"figures\": [],\n1225\t    \"analysis\": \"signal survival在reframed论文中升级为Core Contribution，但finding从 \\\"cliff-like degradation\\\"改为\\\"gradual, benchmark-dependent degradation refuting clean regime boundaries\\\"。这个reframe实际上更novel： (1) 它challenge了detection community中隐含的\\\"signals work until they don't\\\"的binary thinking； (2) 它建立了\\\"signal quality is a continuous, context-dependent quantity\\\"的empirical evidence； (3) Benchmark-specific signal ordering在RL regime下的变化是一个practical finding—— 不存在universal \\\"best signal for RL\\\"，需要adaptive signal selection。 关键叙事转变：从\\\"Self-Critique compensates where others fail\\\"到 \\\"no signal compensates adequately in any regime beyond SFT\\\"。\\n\\n\\nsignal survival分析在worst档下揭示了detection信号的systematic fragility， 但关键的\\\"cliff-like degradation\\\"假设未得到支持： (1) Base→SFT→RL确实存在degradation trend（ANOVA p=0.008），但是gradual而非cliff-like—— 每个regime transition（Base→SFT, SFT→RL）的AUC drop ~0.035/step， 没有在任何specific boundary出现sharp discontinuity。这refutes了\\\"clean regime boundaries\\\"的假设； (2) SFT clean vs contaminated差异仅0.02 AUC——信号主要检测\\\"training change\\\"而非 \\\"contamination change\\\"，SFT本身（无论内容）就改变了model representations enough to affect detection signals。这是一个methodological concern：信号的SFT-regime AUC 可能partly由SFT procedure本身驱动而非contamination； (3) Self-Critique在RL下\\\"最佳\\\"（0.54）但是pyrrhic victory——0.54的AUC 仅比random（0.50）好4pp，sensitivity+specificity之和≈1.08，几乎无practical value。 且这个\\\"最佳\\\"因benchmark而异：MMLU上embedding更好（0.60），GSM8K上Self-Critique更好（0.56）， HumanEval上ConStat更好（0.53）——没有universal winner意味着无法有principled的 \\\"RL regime下用什么信号\\\"的recommendation； (4) All signals在RL下<0.60，confirm了exp-004的identifiability threshold prediction—— RL regime系统性落在identifiability boundary以下，任何calibration method都无法工作； (5) Benchmark-specific ordering changes（不同benchmark上不同信号\\\"最佳\\\"） 说明信号quality与benchmark type交互，不是universal property—— 这对practical deployment是一个complication（需要per-benchmark signal selection）。\\n\"\n1226\t  },\n1227\t  {\n1228\t    \"name\": \"rl_observational_case_study\",\n1229\t    \"description\": \"RL-trained models（Qwen2.5-Instruct, DeepSeek-R1-Distill）的观察性案例。 worst档下calibration在RL regime完全失效，expected regret reduction为零或负。\\n\",\n1230\t    \"results\": {\n1231\t      \"models_evaluated\": 8,\n1232\t      \"selfcritique_auc_avg_rl\": 0.54,\n1233\t      \"rrf_auc_avg_rl\": 0.53,\n1234\t      \"calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp\": 11.2,\n1235\t      \"calibration_mae_uncalibrated_pp\": 9.5,\n1236\t      \"calibration_mae_remove_rescore_pp\": 8.8,\n1237\t      \"calibration_mae_linear_pp\": 10.2,\n1238\t      \"calibration_mae_dcr_pp\": 9.0,\n1239\t      \"ci_width_95_avg_pp\": 24.0,\n1240\t      \"ci_coverage_95\": 0.8,\n1241\t      \"ci_coverage_80\": 0.62,\n1242\t      \"expected_regret_reduction_vs_uncalibrated\": -0.05,\n1243\t      \"expected_regret_reduction_vs_remove_rescore\": -0.1,\n1244\t      \"top5_model_selection_agreement_with_true\": 0.6,\n1245\t      \"gamma_estimates_mean\": 0.06,\n1246\t      \"gamma_ci_includes_zero_pct\": 0.88,\n1247\t      \"nearzero_gamma_clean_benchmark_value\": 0.02,\n1248\t      \"nearzero_gamma_clean_check_pass\": true,\n1249\t      \"deepseek_r1_gamma_ci_includes_zero\": true,\n1250\t      \"deepseek_r1_7b_gamma\": 0.04\n1251\t    },\n1252\t    \"tables\": [\n1253\t      {\n1254\t        \"name\": \"Table: RL Case Study — Method Comparison\",\n1255\t        \"columns\": [\n1256\t          \"method\",\n1257\t          \"MAE_pp\",\n1258\t          \"CI Width 95%\",\n1259\t          \"Coverage 95%\",\n1260\t          \"Regret Δ\"\n1261\t        ],\n1262\t        \"rows\": [\n1263\t          [\n1264\t            \"Uncalibrated (naive)\",\n1265\t            9.5,\n1266\t            \"—\",\n1267\t            \"—\",\n1268\t            \"—\"\n1269\t          ],\n1270\t          [\n1271\t            \"4PL+γ\",\n1272\t            11.2,\n1273\t            24.0,\n1274\t            0.8,\n1275\t            -0.05\n1276\t          ],\n1277\t          [\n1278\t            \"Remove-rescore\",\n1279\t            8.8,\n1280\t            \"—\",\n1281\t            \"—\",\n1282\t            \"—\"\n1283\t          ],\n1284\t          [\n1285\t            \"Linear regression+CI\",\n1286\t            10.2,\n1287\t            20.5,\n1288\t            0.83,\n1289\t            0.01\n1290\t          ],\n1291\t          [\n1292\t            \"DCR\",\n1293\t            9.0,\n1294\t            \"—\",\n1295\t            \"—\",\n1296\t            \"—\"\n1297\t          ]\n1298\t        ]\n1299\t      },\n1300\t      {\n1301\t        \"name\": \"Table: Per-Model γ Estimates (RL models)\",\n1302\t        \"columns\": [\n1303\t          \"model\",\n1304\t          \"gamma_mean\",\n1305\t          \"gamma_95ci_lower\",\n1306\t          \"gamma_95ci_upper\",\n1307\t          \"ci_excludes_zero\"\n1308\t        ],\n1309\t        \"rows\": [\n1310\t          [\n1311\t            \"Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct\",\n1312\t            0.1,\n1313\t            -0.18,\n1314\t            0.38,\n1315\t            false\n1316\t          ],\n1317\t          [\n1318\t            \"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct\",\n1319\t            0.07,\n1320\t            -0.2,\n1321\t            0.34,\n1322\t            false\n1323\t          ],\n1324\t          [\n1325\t            \"Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\",\n1326\t            0.05,\n1327\t            -0.22,\n1328\t            0.32,\n1329\t            false\n1330\t          ],\n1331\t          [\n1332\t            \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\",\n1333\t            0.02,\n1334\t            -0.28,\n1335\t            0.32,\n1336\t            false\n1337\t          ],\n1338\t          [\n1339\t            \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B\",\n1340\t            0.08,\n1341\t            -0.16,\n1342\t            0.32,\n1343\t            false\n1344\t          ],\n1345\t          [\n1346\t            \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B\",\n1347\t            0.04,\n1348\t            -0.22,\n1349\t            0.3,\n1350\t            false\n1351\t          ]\n1352\t        ]\n1353\t      }\n1354\t    ],\n1355\t    \"figures\": [],\n1356\t    \"analysis\": \"RL case study提供了worst档最compelling的negative result：calibration not merely fails to help but actively harms decision quality in the RL regime。 (1) 这是因为signal AUC<0.55时IRT的额外parameters成为pure noise amplifiers； (2) Practical recommendation：\\\"do not attempt calibration when signal AUC < 0.60\\\"—— 这是一个clear, actionable, negative finding with theoretical backing from exp-004； (3) Specificity check通过（γ=0.02 on clean benchmark）是唯一positive—— 模型不产生false contamination detection，但也检测不到real contamination。 DCR/remove-rescore在RL下也mediocre，supporting \\\"the problem is intractable, not the method\\\"。\\n\\n\\nRL observational是worst档中最dramatic的negative result——calibration actively hurts： (1) Signal AUC 0.53-0.54在RL regime下（exp-008已预测），exposure scores本质上是random noise， 输入到IRT的是garbage——garbage-in-garbage-out； (2) 4PL+γ MAE 11.2pp比uncalibrated 9.5pp还差1.7pp——模型在noisy exposure上\\\"hallucinate\\\"了 不存在的contamination effect，做出了比不校正更差的adjustment： false positives被overcorrect（本来对的答案被down-adjust）， true positives被undercorrect（真正contaminated的items信号太弱未被识别）； (3) Expected regret为-0.05（vs uncalibrated）和-0.10（vs remove-rescore）， calibration使model selection决策literally变差——宽CI（24pp）使rankings变得更noisy 而uncalibrated scores虽biased但至少preserves relative ordering better； (4) 88%的conditions下γ CI包含零——模型在RL regime下根本检测不到contamination， 不是\\\"检测到但校正不够\\\"而是\\\"γ与zero不可区分\\\"。 Mean γ=0.06接近clean benchmark的specificity check（γ=0.02）， 说明RL模型和clean data上的γ estimates没有meaningful difference； (5) DCR和remove-rescore在RL下也不好（9.0pp/8.8pp vs naive 9.5pp）， 但至少没有actively hurt——simpler methods的conservatism在low-signal regime下是一个virtue。\\n\"\n1357\t  },\n1358\t  {\n1359\t    \"name\": \"multi_family_validation\",\n1360\t    \"description\": \"非Qwen模型家族（Llama-3.2-1B或Pythia-1.4B）的controlled SFT注入验证，3 dosage levels。 worst档下第二模型家族结果与Qwen方向不一致或因GPU预算耗尽无法完成。\\n\",\n1361\t    \"results\": {\n1362\t      \"model_family\": \"Llama-3.2-1B\",\n1363\t      \"dosages_completed\": [\n1364\t        \"0%\",\n1365\t        \"25%\",\n1366\t        \"100%\"\n1367\t      ],\n1368\t      \"seeds_completed\": 1,\n1369\t      \"gpu_budget_exhausted_partial\": true,\n1370\t      \"mmlu_inflation_100pct_pp\": 5.8,\n1371\t      \"mmlu_inflation_25pct_pp\": 1.5,\n1372\t      \"gsm8k_inflation_100pct_pp\": 2.2,\n1373\t      \"signal_auc_embedding_100pct\": 0.62,\n1374\t      \"signal_auc_rrf_100pct\": 0.6,\n1375\t      \"calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp\": 9.5,\n1376\t      \"calibration_mae_qwen_1_5b_matched_pp\": 6.2,\n1377\t      \"multi_family_mae_gap_pp\": 6.5,\n1378\t      \"gamma_estimate_100pct\": 0.2,\n1379\t      \"gamma_ci_includes_zero_100pct\": true,\n1380\t      \"gamma_direction_consistent_with_qwen\": false,\n1381\t      \"inflation_pattern_consistent_with_qwen\": false,\n1382\t      \"inflation_pattern_difference\": \"Llama inflation更集中在MMLU（5.8pp vs GSM8K 2.2pp）， 与Qwen的更均匀分布不同。γ estimate方向一致（positive）但magnitude不同（0.20 vs 0.40）， 且CI包含零而Qwen在100%dosage下不包含。\"\n1383\t    },\n1384\t    \"tables\": [\n1385\t      {\n1386\t        \"name\": \"Table: Multi-Family Comparison (Llama-3.2-1B vs Qwen2.5-1.5B, 100% dosage)\",\n1387\t        \"columns\": [\n1388\t          \"metric\",\n1389\t          \"Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n1390\t          \"Llama-3.2-1B\",\n1391\t          \"gap\"\n1392\t        ],\n1393\t        \"rows\": [\n1394\t          [\n1395\t            \"MMLU inflation (pp)\",\n1396\t            7.4,\n1397\t            5.8,\n1398\t            -1.6\n1399\t          ],\n1400\t          [\n1401\t            \"GSM8K inflation (pp)\",\n1402\t            4.8,\n1403\t            2.2,\n1404\t            -2.6\n1405\t          ],\n1406\t          [\n1407\t            \"Embedding AUC\",\n1408\t            0.72,\n1409\t            0.62,\n1410\t            -0.1\n1411\t          ],\n1412\t          [\n1413\t            \"RRF AUC\",\n1414\t            0.68,\n1415\t            0.6,\n1416\t            -0.08\n1417\t          ],\n1418\t          [\n1419\t            \"γ estimate\",\n1420\t            0.4,\n1421\t            0.2,\n1422\t            -0.2\n1423\t          ],\n1424\t          [\n1425\t            \"γ CI excludes zero\",\n1426\t            true,\n1427\t            false,\n1428\t            \"—\"\n1429\t          ],\n1430\t          [\n1431\t            \"Calibration MAE (pp)\",\n1432\t            6.2,\n1433\t            9.5,\n1434\t            3.3\n1435\t          ]\n1436\t        ]\n1437\t      }\n1438\t    ],\n1439\t    \"figures\": [],\n1440\t    \"analysis\": \"multi-family结果是worst档generalizability concern的direct confirmation。 6.5pp MAE gap（在[4.0, 10.0]范围内）说明ContamCal的calibration accuracy 是model-family-dependent的——这是一个significant limitation因为paper claims need to generalize。 reframed论文策略：(1) Acknowledge limitation explicitly with quantified gap； (2) Argue this supports the \\\"possibility frontier\\\" framing——identifiability map is family-specific, further narrowing the conditions under which calibration works； (3) Single-seed caveat needs prominent placement in limitations section。\\n\\n\\nmulti-family validation在worst档下暴露了generalizability的fundamental challenge： (1) GPU预算紧张——Llama-3.2-1B的SFT需要重新适配tokenizer和training config， 调试时间消耗了buffer hours，最终只完成3个dosage level×1 seed（计划是3 dosages×3 seeds）； (2) Llama-3.2-1B的inflation pattern与Qwen2.5-1.5B系统性不同—— Llama在MMLU上inflation 5.8pp vs GSM8K仅2.2pp（ratio 2.6:1）， 而Qwen在matched scale(1.5B)上是7.4pp vs 4.8pp（ratio 1.5:1）。 这说明contamination effect是architecture-dependent的，挑战了γ的universal interpretation； (3) Signal AUC在Llama上更低（embedding 0.62 vs Qwen 0.72）—— 可能因为Llama的tokenization和embedding space与signal tools（基于sentence-transformers） 的compatibility不同，或Llama的SFT dynamics导致不同的memorization pattern； (4) γ CI在Llama 100%dosage下包含零（而Qwen不包含）——即使在最极端的contamination下 Llama模型的contamination effect也不可被reliable地检测，进一步收窄了identifiability map； (5) Calibration MAE gap 6.5pp（Llama 9.5pp vs Qwen 6.2pp at matched scale）—— 3.3pp的差距远超跨seed variance（<1.5pp），说明method performance是family-specific的， 不能从一个model family泛化到另一个。 仅1 seed使所有comparisons都是underpowered的——这一限制需要在paper中explicitly disclosed。\\n\"\n1441\t  },\n1442\t  {\n1443\t    \"name\": \"observational_72b\",\n1444\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-72B观察性分析（仅推理，无SFT）。worst档下frontier scale 使所有信号接近random，γ不可与zero区分。\\n\",\n1445\t    \"results\": {\n1446\t      \"signal_auc_embedding\": 0.58,\n1447\t      \"signal_auc_minkpp\": 0.54,\n1448\t      \"signal_auc_constat\": 0.52,\n1449\t      \"signal_auc_selfcritique\": 0.56,\n1450\t      \"rrf_auc\": 0.56,\n1451\t      \"gamma_estimate\": 0.03,\n1452\t      \"gamma_ci_includes_zero\": true,\n1453\t      \"gamma_ci_width\": 0.6,\n1454\t      \"calibration_mae_pp\": 11.8,\n1455\t      \"ci_width_95_pp\": 27.0,\n1456\t      \"ci_coverage_95\": 0.78\n1457\t    },\n1458\t    \"tables\": [\n1459\t      {\n1460\t        \"name\": \"Table: 72B Observational Results vs Controlled Models\",\n1461\t        \"columns\": [\n1462\t          \"metric\",\n1463\t          \"Qwen-3B (ctrl)\",\n1464\t          \"Qwen-7B (ctrl)\",\n1465\t          \"Qwen-72B (obs)\"\n1466\t        ],\n1467\t        \"rows\": [\n1468\t          [\n1469\t            \"Best signal AUC\",\n1470\t            0.67,\n1471\t            0.64,\n1472\t            0.58\n1473\t          ],\n1474\t          [\n1475\t            \"RRF AUC\",\n1476\t            0.65,\n1477\t            0.62,\n1478\t            0.56\n1479\t          ],\n1480\t          [\n1481\t            \"γ estimate\",\n1482\t            0.34,\n1483\t            0.22,\n1484\t            0.03\n1485\t          ],\n1486\t          [\n1487\t            \"γ CI excludes zero\",\n1488\t            true,\n1489\t            \"marginal\",\n1490\t            false\n1491\t          ],\n1492\t          [\n1493\t            \"Calibration MAE (pp)\",\n1494\t            6.8,\n1495\t            8.2,\n1496\t            11.8\n1497\t          ],\n1498\t          [\n1499\t            \"CI width 95% (pp)\",\n1500\t            9.5,\n1501\t            11.5,\n1502\t            27.0\n1503\t          ]\n1504\t        ]\n1505\t      }\n1506\t    ],\n1507\t    \"figures\": [],\n1508\t    \"analysis\": \"72B是identifiability story的natural endpoint和strongest rhetoric： \\\"The very models most scrutinized for contamination (large, frontier) are precisely those where our theoretical analysis proves calibration is infeasible. This is not a limitation of ContamCal but a fundamental property of the problem: as models grow larger, the boundary between 'knowledge' and 'contamination' blurs, and detection signals lose their discriminative power.\\\" 这个framing将worst-tier result转化为paper的powerful closing argument。\\n\\n\\n72B将scale问题推向极端： (1) 72B的pretraining corpus几乎确定包含benchmark items的某种形式—— 这不是\\\"contamination\\\"而是\\\"knowledge acquisition\\\"，使得\\\"contaminated vs clean\\\"的 binary distinction在概念层面就不再清晰。所有detection signals的false positive rate极高， embedding retrieval AUC降至0.58因为72B legitimately \\\"knows\\\" nearly everything in benchmarks； (2) γ=0.03几乎为零，不是因为无contamination而是因为unable to detect—— 信号noise完全淹没了any real signal，CI width 0.60意味着γ的95%CI覆盖[-0.27, 0.33]， 这个range trivially包含了从\\\"no contamination\\\"到\\\"moderate contamination\\\"的所有可能； (3) 11.8pp MAE是worst档中最差的calibration error——72B的item response patterns 系统性不同于smaller models（difficulty ordering不同、ceiling effects更多）， IRT parameters的transferability across scales受到根本挑战； (4) 27pp CI width使calibration statement完全vacuous——\\\"score在±13.5pp范围内\\\" 对于一个82%准确率的72B模型意味着\\\"真实score在68.5%-95.5%之间\\\"，无actionable value。\\n\"\n1509\t  },\n1510\t  {\n1511\t    \"name\": \"closed_weight_2signal_mode\",\n1512\t    \"description\": \"2-signal degraded mode (ConStat + Self-Critique) for closed-weight models。 worst档下降级模式使calibration完全不可行，Kendall τ低于0.5。\\n\",\n1513\t    \"results\": {\n1514\t      \"two_signal_rrf_auc_100pct\": 0.62,\n1515\t      \"two_signal_rrf_auc_50pct\": 0.56,\n1516\t      \"two_signal_rrf_auc_25pct\": 0.53,\n1517\t      \"calibration_mae_2signal_pp\": 9.8,\n1518\t      \"calibration_mae_4signal_pp\": 6.8,\n1519\t      \"mae_increase_relative_2_vs_4\": 0.44,\n1520\t      \"ci_width_95_2signal_pp\": 22.0,\n1521\t      \"ci_coverage_95_2signal\": 0.74,\n1522\t      \"kendall_tau_2signal\": 0.52,\n1523\t      \"gamma_ci_includes_zero_2signal_pct\": 0.75,\n1524\t      \"dcr_mae_on_same_conditions_pp\": 8.5,\n1525\t      \"two_signal_worse_than_dcr\": true\n1526\t    },\n1527\t    \"tables\": [\n1528\t      {\n1529\t        \"name\": \"Table: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal vs DCR\",\n1530\t        \"columns\": [\n1531\t          \"metric\",\n1532\t          \"4-signal\",\n1533\t          \"2-signal\",\n1534\t          \"DCR\",\n1535\t          \"degradation\"\n1536\t        ],\n1537\t        \"rows\": [\n1538\t          [\n1539\t            \"RRF AUC (100%)\",\n1540\t            0.68,\n1541\t            0.62,\n1542\t            \"—\",\n1543\t            \"-8.8%\"\n1544\t          ],\n1545\t          [\n1546\t            \"MAE (pp)\",\n1547\t            6.8,\n1548\t            9.8,\n1549\t            8.5,\n1550\t            \"+44%\"\n1551\t          ],\n1552\t          [\n1553\t            \"CI Width 95% (pp)\",\n1554\t            9.5,\n1555\t            22.0,\n1556\t            \"—\",\n1557\t            \"+132%\"\n1558\t          ],\n1559\t          [\n1560\t            \"Kendall τ\",\n1561\t            0.72,\n1562\t            0.52,\n1563\t            0.68,\n1564\t            \"-28%\"\n1565\t          ],\n1566\t          [\n1567\t            \"Coverage 95%\",\n1568\t            0.76,\n1569\t            0.74,\n1570\t            \"—\",\n1571\t            \"-2.6%\"\n1572\t          ]\n1573\t        ]\n1574\t      }\n1575\t    ],\n1576\t    \"figures\": [],\n1577\t    \"analysis\": \"2-signal failure confirms critical practical constraint：closed-weight models (GPT-4, Claude等)——恰好是contamination scrutiny最高的——是calibration最不可行的targets。 identifiability map需要\\\"signal access level\\\"维度：full-access(4-signal)的viable region 已经很小（AUC>0.72, N>80），closed-weight(2-signal)的viable region几乎不存在 （需要AUC>0.85 AND N>150，现实中不可能达到）。 这是reframed论文的一个strong practical insight： \\\"The models with the least transparency are also the most opaque to calibration.\\\"\\n\\n2-signal mode在worst档下是最不viable的配置： (1) ConStat和Self-Critique是四个信号中AUC最低的两个（exp-002）， fusion AUC 0.62远低于identifiability threshold 0.72—— closed-weight场景下可用的信号恰好是最差的，因为最好的信号（Embedding, Min-K++） 需要model internals access（embeddings, logits）； (2) MAE增加44%（6.8→9.8pp）——接近uncalibrated raw score的MAE（8.5pp）， 说明calibration几乎没有净价值； (3) Kendall τ降至0.52——刚刚高于random（0.50），calibrated rankings 与true rankings的agreement barely better than coin flip； (4) 75%的conditions下γ CI包含零——在closed-weight scenario下 contamination detection几乎完全不可行； (5) DCR在same conditions下MAE 8.5pp，优于2-signal ContamCal的9.8pp—— simpler method再次胜出，因为DCR不依赖信号aggregation。\\n\"\n1578\t  }\n1579\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"37180125-e5f8-4579-a9c5-c1cce01882ec","uuid":"815baca4-9f82-4373-a3f8-5234c704bb5c","timestamp":"2026-05-13T17:45:10.547Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T171200/worst/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"controlled_sft_injection\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B × 5 dosage levels SFT注入。worst档下注入机制本身成功， 但inflation pattern noisy——低dosage无可测效应，高dosage效应被model capacity截断， 跨benchmark/scale差异大，挑战additive γ的model specification。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sft_runs_completed\": 15,\n      \"mmlu_inflation_0pct_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"mmlu_inflation_5pct_pp\": 0.9,\n      \"mmlu_inflation_25pct_pp\": 2.3,\n      \"mmlu_inflation_50pct_pp\": 4.8,\n      \"mmlu_inflation_100pct_pp\": 8.5,\n      \"gsm8k_inflation_100pct_pp\": 4.8,\n      \"arc_inflation_100pct_pp\": 6.2,\n      \"humaneval_inflation_100pct_pp\": 3.5,\n      \"inflation_spearman_mmlu\": 0.9,\n      \"inflation_spearman_gsm8k\": 0.7,\n      \"inflation_variance_across_seeds_std_pp\": 2.9,\n      \"qwen_0_5b_inflation_100pct_mmlu_pp\": 11.8,\n      \"qwen_3b_inflation_100pct_mmlu_pp\": 5.5,\n      \"low_dosage_5pct_detectable\": false,\n      \"low_dosage_25pct_detectable_marginal\": true,\n      \"paraphrase_cosine_sim_mean\": 0.87,\n      \"paraphrase_bleu_mean\": 0.24\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Score Inflation (pp) by Model × Dosage × Benchmark\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"model\",\n          \"benchmark\",\n          \"0%\",\n          \"5%\",\n          \"25%\",\n          \"50%\",\n          \"100%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-0.5B\",\n            \"MMLU\",\n            42.1,\n            43.0,\n            45.5,\n            49.3,\n            53.9\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-0.5B\",\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            30.8,\n            31.1,\n            32.3,\n            33.8,\n            35.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-0.5B\",\n            \"ARC-C\",\n            37.9,\n            38.5,\n            40.0,\n            42.4,\n            45.2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-0.5B\",\n            \"HumanEval\",\n            21.3,\n            21.5,\n            22.2,\n            23.5,\n            25.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n            \"MMLU\",\n            52.8,\n            53.4,\n            54.9,\n            56.8,\n            60.2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            48.2,\n            48.5,\n            49.6,\n            51.2,\n            53.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n            \"ARC-C\",\n            51.6,\n            52.0,\n            53.2,\n            55.0,\n            57.5\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n            \"HumanEval\",\n            34.8,\n            35.0,\n            35.8,\n            37.0,\n            38.4\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-3B\",\n            \"MMLU\",\n            61.5,\n            61.8,\n            62.8,\n            64.3,\n            67.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-3B\",\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            62.0,\n            62.2,\n            62.9,\n            63.8,\n            65.2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-3B\",\n            \"ARC-C\",\n            60.2,\n            60.5,\n            61.4,\n            62.8,\n            65.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-3B\",\n            \"HumanEval\",\n            47.8,\n            48.0,\n            48.6,\n            49.7,\n            51.3\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"注入成功但暴露两个关键弱点：(1) 低dosage信号不存在（5%不可检出），dose-response低端崩溃； (2) inflation幅度跨benchmark差异达2.4×（3.5-8.5pp at 100%），且与scale反相关， 表明contamination effect不是additive constant而是ability×benchmark的交互项—— 这从specification层面挑战了4PL+γ的additive model。 reframed论文角度：这些non-uniform patterns反而支持\\\"contamination calibration需要benchmark-specific treatment\\\"的论点，per-benchmark γ_k的引入有了更强的empirical motivation。\\n\\n\\nSFT注入是成熟技术，15个run全部完成。但worst档的问题从inflation pattern开始： (1) 5%dosage inflation仅0.9pp（MMLU ~700 items被注入），被seed noise（std~2.9pp）完全淹没， 与0%无统计差异——这直接破坏了后续dose-response分析在低端的sensitivity； (2) 0.5B模型inflation 11.8pp vs 3B仅5.5pp，因为小模型capacity限制使SFT更多转化为memorization 而非泛化，但大模型pretraining已覆盖部分knowledge——inflation与scale反相关创造γ-θ confounding的根源； (3) GSM8K/HumanEval inflation显著弱于MMLU（4.8pp/3.5pp vs 8.5pp），因为reasoning/code benchmark的paraphrase memorization转化率低——原始答案结构不同于MCQ，模型需要generate而非recognize； (4) 跨benchmark inflation 3×差异（3.5-8.5pp）从根本上挑战了global γ的additive假设—— contamination effect不是常数而是benchmark-specific的，且与model ability交互。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"stage1_signal_pipeline\",\n    \"description\": \"4个检测信号在exp-001所有模型上的计算。worst档下信号质量系统性低于仿真假设的AUC水平， 且信号间冗余度高，互补性假设不成立。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"embedding_auc_sft_100pct_avg\": 0.71,\n      \"embedding_auc_sft_5pct_avg\": 0.53,\n      \"minkpp_auc_sft_100pct_avg\": 0.66,\n      \"minkpp_auc_sft_5pct_avg\": 0.52,\n      \"constat_auc_sft_100pct_avg\": 0.63,\n      \"constat_auc_sft_25pct_avg\": 0.56,\n      \"selfcritique_auc_sft_100pct_avg\": 0.6,\n      \"selfcritique_auc_sft_5pct_avg\": 0.51,\n      \"avg_signal_auc_across_all_conditions\": 0.59,\n      \"signal_auc_variance_across_benchmarks\": 0.009,\n      \"embedding_auc_qwen0_5b_100pct\": 0.74,\n      \"embedding_auc_qwen3b_100pct\": 0.67,\n      \"minkpp_fp_rate_at_90pct_recall\": 0.48,\n      \"constat_requires_paraphrase_availability\": true,\n      \"selfcritique_entropy_separation_cohens_d\": 0.35,\n      \"pairwise_signal_corr_avg\": 0.55\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Signal AUC by Dosage (averaged across models and benchmarks)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"signal\",\n          \"5%\",\n          \"25%\",\n          \"50%\",\n          \"100%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Embedding Retrieval\",\n            0.53,\n            0.61,\n            0.67,\n            0.71\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Min-K%++\",\n            0.52,\n            0.57,\n            0.62,\n            0.66\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ConStat\",\n            0.51,\n            0.55,\n            0.6,\n            0.63\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Self-Critique\",\n            0.51,\n            0.54,\n            0.57,\n            0.6\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Signal AUC by Model Scale at 100% Dosage (MMLU)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"signal\",\n          \"Qwen-0.5B\",\n          \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n          \"Qwen-3B\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Embedding Retrieval\",\n            0.74,\n            0.72,\n            0.67\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Min-K%++\",\n            0.7,\n            0.67,\n            0.62\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ConStat\",\n            0.66,\n            0.64,\n            0.6\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Self-Critique\",\n            0.55,\n            0.61,\n            0.64\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"信号质量是worst档所有下游failure的根本原因。exp-004仿真将证明AUC≥0.70是identifiability threshold， 而真实数据中只有embedding×100%dosage勉强达到。更严重的是catch-22： 高dosage容易检测但calibration价值低（显然contaminated），低dosage需要检测但信号不存在。 信号间corr 0.55意味着~30%共享方差，RRF fusion的信息增量有限。 reframed论文：这直接motivate了\\\"possibility frontier\\\"叙事——当前信号技术不足以支撑calibration。\\n\\n\\nworst档的核心机制在信号质量上发力： (1) Embedding retrieval在100%dosage下AUC 0.71，是唯一接近仿真假设0.70阈值的信号—— 但这个AUC检测的是\\\"item是否在训练集中存在语义近邻\\\"而非\\\"模型是否因此获益\\\"，是proximity信号非causal信号； (2) Min-K%++下降至0.66，因为SFT本身（无论contaminated与否）改变perplexity landscape， SFT-clean模型的token distribution已经偏移，使得contamination-specific signal被dilute； (3) ConStat AUC仅0.63——我们的注入恰好使用paraphrases，ConStat测量的original-vs-paraphrase gap 被注入本身压缩（模型同时见过original-like和paraphrase内容）； (4) Self-Critique在0.5B/1.5B模型上几乎不工作（AUC~0.53-0.55），因为小模型的self-evaluation能力 本身不可靠，Self-Critique需要足够的meta-cognitive能力来\\\"审视自己的知识来源\\\"； (5) 关键：所有信号在5%dosage下AUC 0.51-0.53，与random不可区分——被contaminate的~70 items 在14K MMLU items中信号被噪声完全淹没。信号间平均相关0.55，远超独立信号假设的~0.2， 互补性有限。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"rrf_aggregation_ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"RRF融合及ablation。worst档下RRF AUC在SFT regime仅0.65（指定范围[0.58,0.70]中值）， 未显著超越最佳单信号，信号间高冗余度使融合收益几乎为零。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"rrf_4signal_auc_100pct_dosage\": 0.68,\n      \"rrf_4signal_auc_50pct_dosage\": 0.63,\n      \"rrf_4signal_auc_25pct_dosage\": 0.58,\n      \"rrf_4signal_auc_5pct_dosage\": 0.53,\n      \"rrf_4signal_auc_avg_across_dosages\": 0.65,\n      \"best_single_signal_auc_100pct\": 0.71,\n      \"rrf_vs_best_single_delta_100pct\": -0.03,\n      \"rrf_vs_best_single_delta_avg\": -0.01,\n      \"rank_avg_auc_100pct\": 0.67,\n      \"calibrated_weighted_rrf_auc_100pct\": 0.69,\n      \"degraded_2signal_auc_100pct\": 0.62,\n      \"degraded_2signal_auc_50pct\": 0.57,\n      \"degraded_2signal_vs_4signal_gap\": 0.06,\n      \"fp_injection_auc_drop_10pct\": 0.05,\n      \"fp_injection_auc_drop_20pct\": 0.1,\n      \"signal_corr_matrix_avg_pairwise_r\": 0.55\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Aggregation Method Comparison (AUC at 100% dosage, avg across benchmarks)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"AUC\",\n          \"Δ vs best single\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Embedding Retrieval (best single)\",\n            0.71,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Min-K%++\",\n            0.66,\n            -0.05\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ConStat\",\n            0.63,\n            -0.08\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Self-Critique\",\n            0.6,\n            -0.11\n          ],\n          [\n            \"RRF (4-signal)\",\n            0.68,\n            -0.03\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Rank Average (4-signal)\",\n            0.67,\n            -0.04\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Weighted RRF (calibrated)\",\n            0.69,\n            -0.02\n          ],\n          [\n            \"2-signal degraded (CS+SC)\",\n            0.62,\n            -0.09\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: RRF AUC across dosage levels\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"5%\",\n          \"25%\",\n          \"50%\",\n          \"100%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"RRF 4-signal\",\n            0.53,\n            0.58,\n            0.63,\n            0.68\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Best single (Embedding)\",\n            0.53,\n            0.61,\n            0.67,\n            0.71\n          ],\n          [\n            \"2-signal degraded\",\n            0.51,\n            0.55,\n            0.57,\n            0.62\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"RRF failure不是方法论问题而是信号空间的structural issue：四个信号共享太多variance。 reframed论文中这变为\\\"signal diversity as identifiability prerequisite\\\"的实证证据—— identifiability不仅需要高AUC还需要低inter-signal correlation。 calibrated weighted RRF勉强是最优aggregation（0.69），但改善不显著（p>0.10 vs embedding alone）。 论文中RRF的定位从\\\"methodological contribution\\\"转为\\\"principled default choice with known limitations\\\"。\\n\\n\\nRRF融合在worst档下失败的根本原因是信号冗余： (1) 四个信号pairwise correlation均值0.55，最高(Embedding-MinK++)达0.65—— 它们都在检测同一latent variable（\\\"item exposure\\\"）的不同noisy proxy，proxy之间高度共线性； (2) RRF在100%dosage下0.68反而低于best single signal embedding(0.71)， 因为等权融合中弱信号(Self-Critique 0.60)拖累了整体——RRF的rank-reciprocal weighting 无法有效downweight fundamentally weak signals； (3) Calibrated weighted RRF(0.69)通过data-driven权重略有改善，但改善不显著且不稳定—— 小样本下最优权重的estimation variance吞噬了理论收益； (4) 2-signal degraded mode(ConStat+Self-Critique=0.62)严重不足，这两个恰是四个中最弱的—— closed-weight场景下可用信号恰好是信息量最少的； (5) FP injection高度敏感：20%FP率导致AUC下降0.10，从0.68降至0.58（接近random）， 说明在realistic noise level下RRF极脆弱。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"simulation_identifiability_sweep\",\n    \"description\": \"144条件系统性仿真扫描(6 AUC × 4 N_models × 3 prior × 2 exposure_type)，10 seeds each。 Fisher Information矩阵分析。在worst档下确认identifiability boundary在AUC~0.72， 真实信号(0.65-0.71)系统性落在boundary以下。包含原exp-010(prior sensitivity)和 exp-011(few-examinee regime)的全部内容。Growing Pains pre-estimation子实验。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"auc_055_n50_gamma_rmse\": 0.52,\n      \"auc_055_n50_gamma_rel_bias\": 0.65,\n      \"auc_055_n50_theta_corr\": 0.48,\n      \"auc_055_n50_coverage_95\": 0.62,\n      \"auc_060_n50_gamma_rmse\": 0.42,\n      \"auc_060_n50_gamma_rel_bias\": 0.52,\n      \"auc_060_n50_theta_corr\": 0.58,\n      \"auc_060_n50_coverage_95\": 0.68,\n      \"auc_065_n50_gamma_rmse\": 0.31,\n      \"auc_065_n50_gamma_rel_bias\": 0.38,\n      \"auc_065_n50_theta_corr\": 0.7,\n      \"auc_065_n50_coverage_95\": 0.74,\n      \"auc_070_n50_gamma_rmse\": 0.19,\n      \"auc_070_n50_gamma_rel_bias\": 0.22,\n      \"auc_070_n50_theta_corr\": 0.82,\n      \"auc_070_n50_coverage_95\": 0.82,\n      \"auc_080_n50_gamma_rmse\": 0.1,\n      \"auc_080_n50_gamma_rel_bias\": 0.12,\n      \"auc_080_n50_theta_corr\": 0.92,\n      \"auc_080_n50_coverage_95\": 0.91,\n      \"auc_090_n50_gamma_rmse\": 0.06,\n      \"auc_090_n50_gamma_rel_bias\": 0.07,\n      \"auc_090_n50_theta_corr\": 0.96,\n      \"auc_090_n50_coverage_95\": 0.94,\n      \"fisher_info_practical_identifiability_threshold_auc\": 0.72,\n      \"fisher_info_structural_identifiability_holds\": true,\n      \"fisher_info_practical_identifiability_at_065\": false,\n      \"fisher_info_gamma_cramer_rao_bound_at_065\": 0.28,\n      \"fisher_info_gamma_cramer_rao_bound_at_080\": 0.09,\n      \"prior_sensitivity_at_auc_065_mae_range_pp\": 2.8,\n      \"prior_sensitivity_at_auc_080_mae_range_pp\": 0.5,\n      \"prior_sensitivity_index_auc_065\": 0.42,\n      \"prior_sensitivity_index_auc_080\": 0.08,\n      \"prior_n005_gamma_shrinkage_at_065\": 0.48,\n      \"prior_n02_gamma_inflation_at_065\": 1.4,\n      \"n20_auc065_gamma_rmse\": 0.45,\n      \"n20_auc065_gamma_rel_bias\": 0.58,\n      \"n20_auc065_coverage_95\": 0.65,\n      \"n50_auc065_gamma_rmse\": 0.31,\n      \"n50_auc065_coverage_95\": 0.74,\n      \"n100_auc065_gamma_rmse\": 0.22,\n      \"n100_auc065_coverage_95\": 0.78,\n      \"n200_auc065_gamma_rmse\": 0.17,\n      \"n200_auc065_coverage_95\": 0.82,\n      \"growing_pains_pretrain_improvement_n20_pct\": 12,\n      \"growing_pains_pretrain_improvement_n50_pct\": 8,\n      \"minimum_n_for_gamma_significant_at_065\": 120,\n      \"minimum_n_for_coverage_nominal_at_065\": \">200\",\n      \"theta_gamma_posterior_corr_auc_065_n50\": 0.58,\n      \"theta_gamma_posterior_corr_auc_070_n50\": 0.42,\n      \"theta_gamma_posterior_corr_auc_080_n50\": 0.25,\n      \"binary_vs_continuous_mae_gap_at_065\": 1.2,\n      \"continuous_exposure_improves_at_high_auc\": true,\n      \"continuous_exposure_hurts_at_low_auc\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Identifiability Map — γ Recovery Metrics by AUC × N_models (default prior N(0,1))\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"AUC\",\n          \"N_models\",\n          \"gamma_RMSE\",\n          \"gamma_rel_bias\",\n          \"theta_corr\",\n          \"coverage_95%\",\n          \"CI_width_pp\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            0.55,\n            50,\n            0.52,\n            \"65%\",\n            0.48,\n            \"62%\",\n            32.0\n          ],\n          [\n            0.6,\n            50,\n            0.42,\n            \"52%\",\n            0.58,\n            \"68%\",\n            26.5\n          ],\n          [\n            0.65,\n            50,\n            0.31,\n            \"38%\",\n            0.7,\n            \"74%\",\n            21.0\n          ],\n          [\n            0.7,\n            50,\n            0.19,\n            \"22%\",\n            0.82,\n            \"82%\",\n            14.5\n          ],\n          [\n            0.8,\n            50,\n            0.1,\n            \"12%\",\n            0.92,\n            \"91%\",\n            8.2\n          ],\n          [\n            0.9,\n            50,\n            0.06,\n            \"7%\",\n            0.96,\n            \"94%\",\n            5.1\n          ],\n          [\n            0.65,\n            20,\n            0.45,\n            \"58%\",\n            0.52,\n            \"65%\",\n            28.5\n          ],\n          [\n            0.65,\n            100,\n            0.22,\n            \"28%\",\n            0.78,\n            \"78%\",\n            16.8\n          ],\n          [\n            0.65,\n            200,\n            0.17,\n            \"21%\",\n            0.84,\n            \"82%\",\n            13.5\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Prior Sensitivity by AUC Level\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"AUC\",\n          \"prior N(0,0.5) MAE\",\n          \"prior N(0,1) MAE\",\n          \"prior N(0,2) MAE\",\n          \"sensitivity_index\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            0.55,\n            12.5,\n            10.8,\n            9.5,\n            0.58\n          ],\n          [\n            0.65,\n            9.0,\n            7.5,\n            6.2,\n            0.42\n          ],\n          [\n            0.7,\n            5.2,\n            4.8,\n            4.5,\n            0.15\n          ],\n          [\n            0.8,\n            2.8,\n            2.6,\n            2.5,\n            0.08\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Fisher Information — Cramér-Rao Bounds for γ\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"AUC\",\n          \"CR bound (sd)\",\n          \"practical identifiable?\",\n          \"min N for γ sig\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            0.55,\n            0.45,\n            \"No\",\n            \">500\"\n          ],\n          [\n            0.6,\n            0.35,\n            \"No\",\n            \">300\"\n          ],\n          [\n            0.65,\n            0.28,\n            \"No\",\n            \">120\"\n          ],\n          [\n            0.7,\n            0.15,\n            \"Marginal\",\n            \"~60\"\n          ],\n          [\n            0.8,\n            0.09,\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"~30\"\n          ],\n          [\n            0.9,\n            0.05,\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"~15\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"这是reframed论文的理论核心。三个层次的贡献： (1) Structural vs practical identifiability的formal distinction——首次在contamination calibration 语境中给出，Fisher Information分析提供了interpretable的AUC threshold（0.72）； (2) Phase transition at AUC~0.70-0.72——不是smooth degradation而是sharp boundary， 这个发现具有prescriptive value：未来的detection signal研究需要以0.72 AUC为minimum target； (3) Prior sensitivity作为under-identification的diagnostic——sensitivity index > 0.30 意味着Bayesian方法的结果本质上由prior而非data决定，这是一个general-purpose diagnostic。 真实信号AUC(0.65-0.71)恰好落在phase transition边界上，解释了所有下游实验的failure mode。\\n\\n\\n144-condition sweep产生的identifiability map是worst档论文的核心理论贡献： (1) Fisher Information分析给出structural identifiability始终成立（γ理论上可由数据唯一确定）， 但practical identifiability在AUC<0.72时崩溃——Cramér-Rao lower bound在AUC=0.65时为0.28， 意味着γ的理论最小标准差已经是0.28（在γ_true=0.50时），任何estimator都无法做到更好； (2) AUC=0.65→0.70是critical transition zone：RMSE从0.31骤降至0.19，coverage从74%跳至82%， θ-γ corr从0.58降至0.42——这不是smooth degradation而是phase transition， 在0.70以下parameters本质上confounded，在0.70以上开始separable； (3) Prior sensitivity在AUC<0.70时剧烈（index 0.42，MAE range 2.8pp）， 说明在低信号质量下结果由modeler's prior choice而非data驱动—— N(0,0.5)将γ shrink 48%，N(0,2)将γ inflate 40%，且对应MAE差异达2.8pp； (4) Few-examinee regime与AUC形成multiplicative interaction：N=20×AUC=0.65时 RMSE=0.45/rel_bias=58%，estimation本质上是noise；即使N=200×AUC=0.65， coverage仍仅82%（未达nominal 95%），且需要>200 models才能让γ显著—— 但现实中绝大多数benchmark evaluation不超过100 models； (5) Binary vs continuous exposure：低AUC下continuous exposure反而更差（+1.2pp MAE）， 因为continuous exposure引入了额外estimation noise维度，而binary虽然粗糙但variance更低。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"noise_propagation_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"噪声传播分析。worst档下measurement error model收敛但产生vacuously wide CIs（>20pp）， 使calibration在实用意义上失去价值——CI覆盖名义上达标但宽度trivially覆盖一切。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"baseline_gamma_ci_width_pp\": 9.5,\n      \"noise_1x_gamma_ci_width_pp\": 14.8,\n      \"noise_1_5x_gamma_ci_width_pp\": 19.5,\n      \"noise_2x_gamma_ci_width_pp\": 26.0,\n      \"baseline_theta_ci_width_pp\": 7.2,\n      \"noise_1x_theta_ci_width_pp\": 11.5,\n      \"noise_1_5x_theta_ci_width_pp\": 15.8,\n      \"noise_2x_theta_ci_width_pp\": 21.5,\n      \"ci_coverage_95_baseline\": 0.76,\n      \"ci_coverage_95_noise_1x\": 0.84,\n      \"ci_coverage_95_noise_1_5x\": 0.91,\n      \"ci_coverage_95_noise_2x\": 0.96,\n      \"measurement_error_model_converged\": true,\n      \"measurement_error_model_gamma_ci_width_pp\": 22.0,\n      \"measurement_error_model_theta_ci_width_pp\": 15.5,\n      \"measurement_error_model_coverage_95\": 0.92,\n      \"measurement_error_model_coverage_80\": 0.78,\n      \"ci_width_exceeds_15pp_pct\": 0.72,\n      \"ci_width_exceeds_20pp_pct\": 0.58,\n      \"selfcritique_estimated_fp_rate\": 0.38,\n      \"selfcritique_estimated_fn_rate\": 0.3,\n      \"embedding_estimated_fp_rate\": 0.22,\n      \"embedding_estimated_fn_rate\": 0.18\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: CI Width and Coverage under Noise Injection and Measurement Error Model\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"noise_level\",\n          \"gamma_ci_width_pp\",\n          \"theta_ci_width_pp\",\n          \"coverage_95%\",\n          \"coverage_80%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"baseline (0x)\",\n            9.5,\n            7.2,\n            0.76,\n            0.58\n          ],\n          [\n            \"matched (1x)\",\n            14.8,\n            11.5,\n            0.84,\n            0.68\n          ],\n          [\n            \"1.5x\",\n            19.5,\n            15.8,\n            0.91,\n            0.78\n          ],\n          [\n            \"2x\",\n            26.0,\n            21.5,\n            0.96,\n            0.88\n          ],\n          [\n            \"measurement error model\",\n            22.0,\n            15.5,\n            0.92,\n            0.78\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"这是worst档最具诊断价值的实验。核心发现可formalize为noise amplification inequality： 当detection signal AUC < 0.70时，IRT模型的measurement error propagation使CI width 超过practical utility threshold（~15pp），且calibration退化为vacuous uncertainty statement。 reframed论文贡献：将identifiability boundary从binary（\\\"能否估计γ\\\"）升级为graded （\\\"估计的γ是否产生actionable calibration\\\"），引入practical identifiability的operational定义。 关键：measurement error model\\\"修复\\\"了coverage（从0.76→0.92）但代价是width（从9.5→22pp）， 这不是bug而是feature——它诚实地报告了\\\"在当前信号质量下我们无法做精确calibration\\\"。\\n\\n\\nnoise propagation在worst档下揭示了precision-coverage的fundamental tradeoff： (1) 基线CI width已是9.5pp（因信号AUC低致γ posterior宽），加上matched noise后膨胀至14.8pp， 1.5x noise达19.5pp——此时一个60%准确率模型的95%CI覆盖[40.2%, 79.8%]，无法做有意义的model selection； (2) Coverage随noise增加从0.76升至0.96——这是overcoverage，不是calibration改善， 是CI变宽到trivially覆盖一切的artifact； (3) Measurement error model收敛但CI width 22pp（>20pp threshold），92%的coverage 看似接近nominal 95%，但代价是58%的conditions下CI宽度超过20pp—— 等价于声明\\\"真实score在40%-80%之间\\\"，这是technically correct but practically vacuous的结论； (4) Self-Critique的FP=38%/FN=30%意味着matched noise level极高—— 接近1/3的标注是错的，这不是calibration能解决的信号质量问题； (5) 即使用最好的信号embedding（FP=22%/FN=18%），measurement error model的CI仍然>18pp， 因为noise propagation是amplifying而非absorbing——低AUC + noise propagation = 信息损失放大。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"irt_calibration_and_baselines\",\n    \"description\": \"核心calibration实验——4PL+γ IRT两个variant（global γ, per-benchmark γ_k）+ 7 baselines（含DCR）。 worst档下4PL+γ不显著优于简单baselines，DCR在部分benchmark上更优或comparable， per-benchmark γ_k要么不收敛要么与global γ无统计差异。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_global_pp\": 6.8,\n      \"calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_global_mmlu_pp\": 5.2,\n      \"calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_global_gsm8k_pp\": 8.5,\n      \"calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_global_arc_pp\": 6.2,\n      \"calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_global_humaneval_pp\": 7.3,\n      \"ci_coverage_95_global\": 0.76,\n      \"ci_coverage_80_global\": 0.58,\n      \"ci_coverage_50_global\": 0.35,\n      \"ci_width_95_avg_pp\": 9.5,\n      \"kendall_tau_global\": 0.72,\n      \"dose_response_spearman\": 0.58,\n      \"dose_response_monotonic\": false,\n      \"dose_response_5pct_gamma_ci_includes_zero\": true,\n      \"dose_response_25pct_gamma_ci_includes_zero\": true,\n      \"dose_response_50pct_gamma_ci_includes_zero\": false,\n      \"dose_response_100pct_gamma_significant\": true,\n      \"gamma_posterior_mean_global\": 0.34,\n      \"gamma_theta_posterior_corr\": 0.63,\n      \"gamma_rel_bias_avg\": 0.32,\n      \"per_benchmark_gamma_k_mmlu_mean\": 0.42,\n      \"per_benchmark_gamma_k_gsm8k_mean\": 0.18,\n      \"per_benchmark_gamma_k_arc_mean\": 0.35,\n      \"per_benchmark_gamma_k_humaneval_ess\": 85,\n      \"per_benchmark_gamma_k_humaneval_rhat\": 1.12,\n      \"per_benchmark_gamma_k_humaneval_converged\": false,\n      \"per_benchmark_gamma_k_vs_global_overlap_pct\": 0.78,\n      \"per_benchmark_gamma_k_significantly_different\": false,\n      \"per_benchmark_gamma_k_mae_pp\": 6.5,\n      \"per_benchmark_gamma_k_mae_vs_global_improvement_pp\": 0.3,\n      \"calibration_mae_raw_pp\": 8.5,\n      \"calibration_mae_remove_rescore_pp\": 7.2,\n      \"calibration_mae_single_2pl_gamma_pp\": 6.5,\n      \"calibration_mae_vanilla_4pl_pp\": 8.8,\n      \"calibration_mae_linear_regression_pp\": 6.2,\n      \"calibration_mae_emperor_pp\": 8.0,\n      \"calibration_mae_dcr_pp\": 6.4,\n      \"dcr_mae_mmlu_pp\": 5.0,\n      \"dcr_mae_gsm8k_pp\": 7.8,\n      \"dcr_mae_arc_pp\": 5.8,\n      \"dcr_mae_humaneval_pp\": 7.0,\n      \"dcr_beats_contam_cal_on_benchmarks\": [\n        \"MMLU\",\n        \"ARC-C\"\n      ],\n      \"dcr_provides_uncertainty\": false,\n      \"paired_ttest_4pl_vs_linear_pvalue\": 0.18,\n      \"paired_ttest_4pl_vs_dcr_pvalue\": 0.35,\n      \"paired_ttest_4pl_vs_single_2pl_pvalue\": 0.42,\n      \"paired_ttest_4pl_vs_remove_rescore_pvalue\": 0.08,\n      \"paired_ttest_4pl_vs_emperor_pvalue\": 0.04,\n      \"paired_ttest_4pl_vs_vanilla_4pl_pvalue\": 0.02,\n      \"baselines_significantly_beaten_count\": 2,\n      \"stan_rhat_max_global\": 1.06,\n      \"stan_divergent_pct_global\": 2.8,\n      \"stan_ess_min_global\": 210,\n      \"ppc_residual_corr_mean\": 0.12,\n      \"ppc_residual_corr_exceeds_005_pct\": 0.35\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Calibration MAE (pp) by Method × Benchmark (mean ± std across 3 seeds)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"MMLU\",\n          \"GSM8K\",\n          \"ARC-C\",\n          \"HumanEval\",\n          \"Average\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"4PL+γ global (ours)\",\n            \"5.2±0.8\",\n            \"8.5±1.5\",\n            \"6.2±1.0\",\n            \"7.3±1.8\",\n            \"6.8±1.1\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"4PL+γ_k per-benchmark\",\n            \"5.0±0.9\",\n            \"8.2±1.6\",\n            \"5.9±1.1\",\n            \"7.0±2.2\",\n            \"6.5±1.2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Raw (no adjustment)\",\n            8.5,\n            7.8,\n            8.2,\n            9.5,\n            8.5\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Remove-and-rescore\",\n            6.5,\n            7.8,\n            6.8,\n            7.7,\n            7.2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Single-signal 2PL+γ\",\n            5.5,\n            7.5,\n            5.8,\n            7.2,\n            6.5\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Vanilla 4PL (no γ)\",\n            8.0,\n            9.5,\n            8.2,\n            9.5,\n            8.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Linear regression+CI\",\n            5.0,\n            7.2,\n            5.5,\n            7.1,\n            6.2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Emperor mitigation\",\n            7.2,\n            8.8,\n            7.5,\n            8.5,\n            8.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DCR (EMNLP 2025)\",\n            5.0,\n            7.8,\n            5.8,\n            7.0,\n            6.4\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Interval Quality Metrics (4PL+γ global)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"MMLU\",\n          \"GSM8K\",\n          \"ARC-C\",\n          \"HumanEval\",\n          \"Average\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Coverage 95%\",\n            0.8,\n            0.72,\n            0.78,\n            0.74,\n            0.76\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Coverage 80%\",\n            0.62,\n            0.52,\n            0.6,\n            0.56,\n            0.58\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Coverage 50%\",\n            0.38,\n            0.3,\n            0.36,\n            0.34,\n            0.35\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CI width 95% (pp)\",\n            8.2,\n            11.5,\n            9.0,\n            9.2,\n            9.5\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Kendall τ\",\n            0.78,\n            0.65,\n            0.75,\n            0.68,\n            0.72\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Dose-Response γ Estimates (global γ, MMLU)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"dosage\",\n          \"gamma_mean\",\n          \"gamma_95ci_lower\",\n          \"gamma_95ci_upper\",\n          \"ci_excludes_zero\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"5%\",\n            0.05,\n            -0.22,\n            0.32,\n            false\n          ],\n          [\n            \"25%\",\n            0.13,\n            -0.1,\n            0.36,\n            false\n          ],\n          [\n            \"50%\",\n            0.26,\n            0.02,\n            0.5,\n            true\n          ],\n          [\n            \"100%\",\n            0.42,\n            0.14,\n            0.7,\n            true\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Per-benchmark γ_k vs Global γ\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"benchmark\",\n          \"γ_k mean\",\n          \"γ_k 95%CI\",\n          \"global γ 95%CI\",\n          \"overlap_pct\",\n          \"converged\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MMLU\",\n            0.42,\n            \"[0.12, 0.72]\",\n            \"[0.10, 0.58]\",\n            \"72%\",\n            true\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            0.18,\n            \"[-0.15, 0.51]\",\n            \"[0.10, 0.58]\",\n            \"85%\",\n            true\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ARC-C\",\n            0.35,\n            \"[0.02, 0.68]\",\n            \"[0.10, 0.58]\",\n            \"78%\",\n            true\n          ],\n          [\n            \"HumanEval\",\n            0.28,\n            \"[-0.30, 0.86]\",\n            \"[0.10, 0.58]\",\n            \"80%\",\n            \"No (ESS=85)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"calibration claim的formal death certificate： (1) 4PL+γ不优于linear regression（p=0.18）——IRT的复杂参数化（a,b,c,d,γ五参数/item） 在当前信号质量和sample size下是over-parameterized，额外complexity被estimation noise吞噬； (2) DCR comparable（p=0.35）且在MMLU/ARC上更好——existing method已经做到comparable甚至更好的 point estimation，ContamCal唯一的theoretical advantage（Bayesian UQ）因CI太宽而无practical value； (3) Per-benchmark γ_k是methodological improvement but empirically vacuous—— 没有足够statistical power区分benchmark effects，HumanEval甚至不收敛； (4) Dose-response非单调 + γ-θ corr=0.63 = additive γ model misspecified + confounded。 Reframed论文角度：这些结果精确match了exp-004的identifiability boundary prediction—— 真实AUC(0.65-0.71)落在phase transition zone，构成\\\"theory-practice alignment\\\"的核心evidence。 DCR的同样mediocre performance可以作为supporting evidence：\\\"不只是ContamCal fail—— 问题本身在当前信号下intractable for any method。\\\"\\n\\n\\n这是worst档calibration claim崩溃的核心实验，多条证据同时指向failure： (1) 4PL+γ global MAE 6.8pp——落在worst档范围[4.5,9.0]中部，看似不糟糕但context matters： linear regression以6.2pp击败它，DCR以6.4pp与其comparable——更复杂的模型反而不如更简单的替代； (2) γ-θ posterior correlation 0.63（>0.6 threshold），confirm identifiability breached—— 模型混淆了\\\"高能力\\\"和\\\"被contaminate\\\"，posterior呈banana/ridge shape导致sampling困难 （2.8% divergences, ESS仅210, R-hat 1.06边缘）； (3) Dose-response非单调：5%和25%的γ CI包含零，仅50%和100%显著—— Spearman仅0.58（远低于monotonic的0.95+），因为低dosage的non-detectable inflation 加上estimation noise产生了random-walk-like的γ path； (4) Per-benchmark γ_k结果disappointing：MMLU γ_k=0.42 vs GSM8K γ_k=0.18—— 方向正确（MMLU inflation确实更高）但HumanEval不收敛（ESS=85, R-hat=1.12， 因为N=164 items对4PL+γ的参数量不足）； γ_k的95%CI之间78%重叠，Wald test显示与global γ无统计差异—— 没有足够power区分benchmark-specific effects； (5) DCR在MMLU和ARC-C上MAE更低（5.0pp/5.8pp vs 5.2pp/6.2pp）， 尽管DCR不提供uncertainty bounds——这是worst档最尴尬的结果之一： 唯一的existing method在point estimation上comparable甚至更好， 而ContamCal的uncertainty advantage因CI太宽（9.5pp）而没有practical value； (6) 仅2个baselines被显著击败（vanilla 4PL和Emperor mitigation）， 但这是低门槛——vanilla 4PL完全忽略contamination，Emperor是已知失败的mitigation。 Coverage 76%严重undercoverage（nominal 95%），且posterior predictive checks显示 35%的item pairs有超过0.05的residual correlation，暗示local independence violation。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"scale_bridging_7b\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B 5个dosage levels的controlled SFT。worst档下scale-up加剧γ-θ confounding—— 更大模型的inflation更小但signal更弱，calibration difficulty与scale正相关。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sft_runs_completed\": 5,\n      \"mmlu_inflation_100pct_pp\": 4.2,\n      \"mmlu_inflation_50pct_pp\": 2.5,\n      \"mmlu_inflation_5pct_pp\": 0.3,\n      \"gsm8k_inflation_100pct_pp\": 2.6,\n      \"signal_auc_embedding_100pct\": 0.64,\n      \"signal_auc_minkpp_100pct\": 0.6,\n      \"signal_auc_rrf_100pct\": 0.62,\n      \"gamma_estimate_100pct\": 0.22,\n      \"gamma_ci_includes_zero_100pct\": false,\n      \"gamma_ci_includes_zero_50pct\": true,\n      \"calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp\": 8.2,\n      \"calibration_mae_linear_regression_pp\": 7.5,\n      \"calibration_mae_dcr_pp\": 7.0,\n      \"gamma_theta_posterior_corr\": 0.68,\n      \"ci_width_95_pp\": 11.5,\n      \"ci_coverage_95\": 0.73,\n      \"kendall_tau\": 0.68,\n      \"inflation_vs_3b_ratio\": 0.49\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: 7B vs Smaller Models at 100% Dosage\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"Qwen-0.5B\",\n          \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n          \"Qwen-3B\",\n          \"Qwen-7B\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MMLU inflation (pp)\",\n            11.8,\n            7.4,\n            5.5,\n            4.2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Embedding AUC\",\n            0.74,\n            0.72,\n            0.67,\n            0.64\n          ],\n          [\n            \"RRF AUC\",\n            0.7,\n            0.68,\n            0.65,\n            0.62\n          ],\n          [\n            \"γ estimate\",\n            0.45,\n            0.4,\n            0.34,\n            0.22\n          ],\n          [\n            \"γ-θ posterior corr\",\n            0.55,\n            0.58,\n            0.63,\n            0.68\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Calibration MAE (pp)\",\n            5.8,\n            6.2,\n            6.8,\n            8.2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CI width 95% (pp)\",\n            7.5,\n            8.2,\n            9.5,\n            11.5\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"7B实验提供了worst档最重要的scaling insight：calibration difficulty与model scale正相关。 这不是方法论failure而是problem structure的fundamental property—— \\\"the models most in need of calibration (large, highly capable) are precisely those where calibration is least feasible\\\"。 对reframed论文：identifiability map获得了第三个维度（signal quality × model count × model scale）， 且scale维度是最novel的——prior identifiability分析未考虑\\\"ability confounds detection\\\"。\\n\\n\\n7B在worst档下表现更差而非更好，揭示了一个fundamental scaling property： (1) Inflation仅4.2pp at 100%（vs 0.5B的11.8pp）——7B的pretraining knowledge已经广泛 覆盖benchmark content，SFT的边际memorization效应递减。5%dosage的0.3pp inflation 完全不可检测（<1/3个standard deviation）； (2) Signal AUC从3B的0.67降至0.64（embedding）——更大模型\\\"naturally knowing the answer\\\" 混淆了contamination signal，detection不再是\\\"did the model see this item\\\" 而是\\\"does the model's knowledge of this item come from pre-training or SFT\\\"—— 后者是一个fundamentally harder问题； (3) γ-θ posterior correlation升至0.68（最高）——7B是最capable的model， ability和contamination的confounding最严重。posterior banana shape更pronounced， 导致更多sampling difficulty（divergences likely >3%）； (4) DCR在7B上MAE 7.0pp，优于4PL+γ的8.2pp——DCR的simpler contamination model 在larger model scale上反而更robust因为它不尝试disentangle ability from contamination； (5) CI width 11.5pp + coverage 73% = simultaneously too wide AND undercovering—— 这说明不仅估计不精确（wide），还misspecified（poor coverage despite width）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"signal_survival_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"Signal × regime AUC heatmap：4 signals × {base, SFT-clean, SFT-contam, RL}。 worst档下关键假设\\\"cliff-like degradation under RL\\\"不成立—— degradation是gradual且benchmark-dependent的，无清晰regime boundary。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"auc_heatmap\": {\n        \"base_embedding\": 0.76,\n        \"base_minkpp\": 0.72,\n        \"base_constat\": 0.69,\n        \"base_selfcritique\": 0.58,\n        \"sft_clean_embedding\": 0.7,\n        \"sft_clean_minkpp\": 0.64,\n        \"sft_clean_constat\": 0.61,\n        \"sft_clean_selfcritique\": 0.56,\n        \"sft_contam_embedding\": 0.71,\n        \"sft_contam_minkpp\": 0.66,\n        \"sft_contam_constat\": 0.63,\n        \"sft_contam_selfcritique\": 0.6,\n        \"rl_embedding\": 0.58,\n        \"rl_minkpp\": 0.52,\n        \"rl_constat\": 0.5,\n        \"rl_selfcritique\": 0.54\n      },\n      \"signal_survival_rate_sft_avg\": 0.9,\n      \"signal_survival_rate_rl_avg\": 0.74,\n      \"rl_best_signal\": \"selfcritique\",\n      \"rl_best_signal_auc\": 0.54,\n      \"rl_all_signals_below_060\": true,\n      \"sft_clean_vs_contam_auc_diff_avg\": 0.02,\n      \"regime_effect_anova_pvalue\": 0.008,\n      \"cliff_test_sft_to_rl_is_cliff\": false,\n      \"cliff_test_gradual_slope\": -0.035,\n      \"benchmark_specific_signal_ordering_changes\": true,\n      \"mmlu_best_rl_signal\": \"embedding\",\n      \"mmlu_rl_embedding_auc\": 0.6,\n      \"gsm8k_best_rl_signal\": \"selfcritique\",\n      \"gsm8k_rl_selfcritique_auc\": 0.56,\n      \"humaneval_best_rl_signal\": \"constat\",\n      \"humaneval_rl_constat_auc\": 0.53\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Signal × Regime AUC Heatmap\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"signal\",\n          \"Base\",\n          \"SFT-Clean\",\n          \"SFT-Contam\",\n          \"RL\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Embedding Retrieval\",\n            0.76,\n            0.7,\n            0.71,\n            0.58\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Min-K%++\",\n            0.72,\n            0.64,\n            0.66,\n            0.52\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ConStat\",\n            0.69,\n            0.61,\n            0.63,\n            0.5\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Self-Critique\",\n            0.58,\n            0.56,\n            0.6,\n            0.54\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Signal Survival Rate (AUC retention relative to Base)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"signal\",\n          \"SFT-Clean\",\n          \"SFT-Contam\",\n          \"RL\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Embedding Retrieval\",\n            0.92,\n            0.93,\n            0.76\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Min-K%++\",\n            0.89,\n            0.92,\n            0.72\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ConStat\",\n            0.88,\n            0.91,\n            0.72\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Self-Critique\",\n            0.97,\n            1.03,\n            0.93\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Best Signal by Regime × Benchmark (AUC)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"benchmark\",\n          \"SFT-best\",\n          \"SFT-AUC\",\n          \"RL-best\",\n          \"RL-AUC\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MMLU\",\n            \"Embedding\",\n            0.74,\n            \"Embedding\",\n            0.6\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            \"Min-K++\",\n            0.65,\n            \"Self-Critique\",\n            0.56\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ARC-C\",\n            \"Embedding\",\n            0.7,\n            \"Self-Critique\",\n            0.55\n          ],\n          [\n            \"HumanEval\",\n            \"Embedding\",\n            0.72,\n            \"ConStat\",\n            0.53\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"signal survival在reframed论文中升级为Core Contribution，但finding从 \\\"cliff-like degradation\\\"改为\\\"gradual, benchmark-dependent degradation refuting clean regime boundaries\\\"。这个reframe实际上更novel： (1) 它challenge了detection community中隐含的\\\"signals work until they don't\\\"的binary thinking； (2) 它建立了\\\"signal quality is a continuous, context-dependent quantity\\\"的empirical evidence； (3) Benchmark-specific signal ordering在RL regime下的变化是一个practical finding—— 不存在universal \\\"best signal for RL\\\"，需要adaptive signal selection。 关键叙事转变：从\\\"Self-Critique compensates where others fail\\\"到 \\\"no signal compensates adequately in any regime beyond SFT\\\"。\\n\\n\\nsignal survival分析在worst档下揭示了detection信号的systematic fragility， 但关键的\\\"cliff-like degradation\\\"假设未得到支持： (1) Base→SFT→RL确实存在degradation trend（ANOVA p=0.008），但是gradual而非cliff-like—— 每个regime transition（Base→SFT, SFT→RL）的AUC drop ~0.035/step， 没有在任何specific boundary出现sharp discontinuity。这refutes了\\\"clean regime boundaries\\\"的假设； (2) SFT clean vs contaminated差异仅0.02 AUC——信号主要检测\\\"training change\\\"而非 \\\"contamination change\\\"，SFT本身（无论内容）就改变了model representations enough to affect detection signals。这是一个methodological concern：信号的SFT-regime AUC 可能partly由SFT procedure本身驱动而非contamination； (3) Self-Critique在RL下\\\"最佳\\\"（0.54）但是pyrrhic victory——0.54的AUC 仅比random（0.50）好4pp，sensitivity+specificity之和≈1.08，几乎无practical value。 且这个\\\"最佳\\\"因benchmark而异：MMLU上embedding更好（0.60），GSM8K上Self-Critique更好（0.56）， HumanEval上ConStat更好（0.53）——没有universal winner意味着无法有principled的 \\\"RL regime下用什么信号\\\"的recommendation； (4) All signals在RL下<0.60，confirm了exp-004的identifiability threshold prediction—— RL regime系统性落在identifiability boundary以下，任何calibration method都无法工作； (5) Benchmark-specific ordering changes（不同benchmark上不同信号\\\"最佳\\\"） 说明信号quality与benchmark type交互，不是universal property—— 这对practical deployment是一个complication（需要per-benchmark signal selection）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"rl_observational_case_study\",\n    \"description\": \"RL-trained models（Qwen2.5-Instruct, DeepSeek-R1-Distill）的观察性案例。 worst档下calibration在RL regime完全失效，expected regret reduction为零或负。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"models_evaluated\": 8,\n      \"selfcritique_auc_avg_rl\": 0.54,\n      \"rrf_auc_avg_rl\": 0.53,\n      \"calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp\": 11.2,\n      \"calibration_mae_uncalibrated_pp\": 9.5,\n      \"calibration_mae_remove_rescore_pp\": 8.8,\n      \"calibration_mae_linear_pp\": 10.2,\n      \"calibration_mae_dcr_pp\": 9.0,\n      \"ci_width_95_avg_pp\": 24.0,\n      \"ci_coverage_95\": 0.8,\n      \"ci_coverage_80\": 0.62,\n      \"expected_regret_reduction_vs_uncalibrated\": -0.05,\n      \"expected_regret_reduction_vs_remove_rescore\": -0.1,\n      \"top5_model_selection_agreement_with_true\": 0.6,\n      \"gamma_estimates_mean\": 0.06,\n      \"gamma_ci_includes_zero_pct\": 0.88,\n      \"nearzero_gamma_clean_benchmark_value\": 0.02,\n      \"nearzero_gamma_clean_check_pass\": true,\n      \"deepseek_r1_gamma_ci_includes_zero\": true,\n      \"deepseek_r1_7b_gamma\": 0.04\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: RL Case Study — Method Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"MAE_pp\",\n          \"CI Width 95%\",\n          \"Coverage 95%\",\n          \"Regret Δ\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Uncalibrated (naive)\",\n            9.5,\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"4PL+γ\",\n            11.2,\n            24.0,\n            0.8,\n            -0.05\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Remove-rescore\",\n            8.8,\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Linear regression+CI\",\n            10.2,\n            20.5,\n            0.83,\n            0.01\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DCR\",\n            9.0,\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Per-Model γ Estimates (RL models)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"model\",\n          \"gamma_mean\",\n          \"gamma_95ci_lower\",\n          \"gamma_95ci_upper\",\n          \"ci_excludes_zero\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct\",\n            0.1,\n            -0.18,\n            0.38,\n            false\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct\",\n            0.07,\n            -0.2,\n            0.34,\n            false\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\",\n            0.05,\n            -0.22,\n            0.32,\n            false\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\",\n            0.02,\n            -0.28,\n            0.32,\n            false\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B\",\n            0.08,\n            -0.16,\n            0.32,\n            false\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B\",\n            0.04,\n            -0.22,\n            0.3,\n            false\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"RL case study提供了worst档最compelling的negative result：calibration not merely fails to help but actively harms decision quality in the RL regime。 (1) 这是因为signal AUC<0.55时IRT的额外parameters成为pure noise amplifiers； (2) Practical recommendation：\\\"do not attempt calibration when signal AUC < 0.60\\\"—— 这是一个clear, actionable, negative finding with theoretical backing from exp-004； (3) Specificity check通过（γ=0.02 on clean benchmark）是唯一positive—— 模型不产生false contamination detection，但也检测不到real contamination。 DCR/remove-rescore在RL下也mediocre，supporting \\\"the problem is intractable, not the method\\\"。\\n\\n\\nRL observational是worst档中最dramatic的negative result——calibration actively hurts： (1) Signal AUC 0.53-0.54在RL regime下（exp-008已预测），exposure scores本质上是random noise， 输入到IRT的是garbage——garbage-in-garbage-out； (2) 4PL+γ MAE 11.2pp比uncalibrated 9.5pp还差1.7pp——模型在noisy exposure上\\\"hallucinate\\\"了 不存在的contamination effect，做出了比不校正更差的adjustment： false positives被overcorrect（本来对的答案被down-adjust）， true positives被undercorrect（真正contaminated的items信号太弱未被识别）； (3) Expected regret为-0.05（vs uncalibrated）和-0.10（vs remove-rescore）， calibration使model selection决策literally变差——宽CI（24pp）使rankings变得更noisy 而uncalibrated scores虽biased但至少preserves relative ordering better； (4) 88%的conditions下γ CI包含零——模型在RL regime下根本检测不到contamination， 不是\\\"检测到但校正不够\\\"而是\\\"γ与zero不可区分\\\"。 Mean γ=0.06接近clean benchmark的specificity check（γ=0.02）， 说明RL模型和clean data上的γ estimates没有meaningful difference； (5) DCR和remove-rescore在RL下也不好（9.0pp/8.8pp vs naive 9.5pp）， 但至少没有actively hurt——simpler methods的conservatism在low-signal regime下是一个virtue。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"multi_family_validation\",\n    \"description\": \"非Qwen模型家族（Llama-3.2-1B或Pythia-1.4B）的controlled SFT注入验证，3 dosage levels。 worst档下第二模型家族结果与Qwen方向不一致或因GPU预算耗尽无法完成。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"model_family\": \"Llama-3.2-1B\",\n      \"dosages_completed\": [\n        \"0%\",\n        \"25%\",\n        \"100%\"\n      ],\n      \"seeds_completed\": 1,\n      \"gpu_budget_exhausted_partial\": true,\n      \"mmlu_inflation_100pct_pp\": 5.8,\n      \"mmlu_inflation_25pct_pp\": 1.5,\n      \"gsm8k_inflation_100pct_pp\": 2.2,\n      \"signal_auc_embedding_100pct\": 0.62,\n      \"signal_auc_rrf_100pct\": 0.6,\n      \"calibration_mae_4pl_gamma_pp\": 9.5,\n      \"calibration_mae_qwen_1_5b_matched_pp\": 6.2,\n      \"multi_family_mae_gap_pp\": 6.5,\n      \"gamma_estimate_100pct\": 0.2,\n      \"gamma_ci_includes_zero_100pct\": true,\n      \"gamma_direction_consistent_with_qwen\": false,\n      \"inflation_pattern_consistent_with_qwen\": false,\n      \"inflation_pattern_difference\": \"Llama inflation更集中在MMLU（5.8pp vs GSM8K 2.2pp）， 与Qwen的更均匀分布不同。γ estimate方向一致（positive）但magnitude不同（0.20 vs 0.40）， 且CI包含零而Qwen在100%dosage下不包含。\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Multi-Family Comparison (Llama-3.2-1B vs Qwen2.5-1.5B, 100% dosage)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n          \"Llama-3.2-1B\",\n          \"gap\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MMLU inflation (pp)\",\n            7.4,\n            5.8,\n            -1.6\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K inflation (pp)\",\n            4.8,\n            2.2,\n            -2.6\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Embedding AUC\",\n            0.72,\n            0.62,\n            -0.1\n          ],\n          [\n            \"RRF AUC\",\n            0.68,\n            0.6,\n            -0.08\n          ],\n          [\n            \"γ estimate\",\n            0.4,\n            0.2,\n            -0.2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"γ CI excludes zero\",\n            true,\n            false,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Calibration MAE (pp)\",\n            6.2,\n            9.5,\n            3.3\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"multi-family结果是worst档generalizability concern的direct confirmation。 6.5pp MAE gap（在[4.0, 10.0]范围内）说明ContamCal的calibration accuracy 是model-family-dependent的——这是一个significant limitation因为paper claims need to generalize。 reframed论文策略：(1) Acknowledge limitation explicitly with quantified gap； (2) Argue this supports the \\\"possibility frontier\\\" framing——identifiability map is family-specific, further narrowing the conditions under which calibration works； (3) Single-seed caveat needs prominent placement in limitations section。\\n\\n\\nmulti-family validation在worst档下暴露了generalizability的fundamental challenge： (1) GPU预算紧张——Llama-3.2-1B的SFT需要重新适配tokenizer和training config， 调试时间消耗了buffer hours，最终只完成3个dosage level×1 seed（计划是3 dosages×3 seeds）； (2) Llama-3.2-1B的inflation pattern与Qwen2.5-1.5B系统性不同—— Llama在MMLU上inflation 5.8pp vs GSM8K仅2.2pp（ratio 2.6:1）， 而Qwen在matched scale(1.5B)上是7.4pp vs 4.8pp（ratio 1.5:1）。 这说明contamination effect是architecture-dependent的，挑战了γ的universal interpretation； (3) Signal AUC在Llama上更低（embedding 0.62 vs Qwen 0.72）—— 可能因为Llama的tokenization和embedding space与signal tools（基于sentence-transformers） 的compatibility不同，或Llama的SFT dynamics导致不同的memorization pattern； (4) γ CI在Llama 100%dosage下包含零（而Qwen不包含）——即使在最极端的contamination下 Llama模型的contamination effect也不可被reliable地检测，进一步收窄了identifiability map； (5) Calibration MAE gap 6.5pp（Llama 9.5pp vs Qwen 6.2pp at matched scale）—— 3.3pp的差距远超跨seed variance（<1.5pp），说明method performance是family-specific的， 不能从一个model family泛化到另一个。 仅1 seed使所有comparisons都是underpowered的——这一限制需要在paper中explicitly disclosed。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"observational_72b\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-72B观察性分析（仅推理，无SFT）。worst档下frontier scale 使所有信号接近random，γ不可与zero区分。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"signal_auc_embedding\": 0.58,\n      \"signal_auc_minkpp\": 0.54,\n      \"signal_auc_constat\": 0.52,\n      \"signal_auc_selfcritique\": 0.56,\n      \"rrf_auc\": 0.56,\n      \"gamma_estimate\": 0.03,\n      \"gamma_ci_includes_zero\": true,\n      \"gamma_ci_width\": 0.6,\n      \"calibration_mae_pp\": 11.8,\n      \"ci_width_95_pp\": 27.0,\n      \"ci_coverage_95\": 0.78\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: 72B Observational Results vs Controlled Models\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"Qwen-3B (ctrl)\",\n          \"Qwen-7B (ctrl)\",\n          \"Qwen-72B (obs)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Best signal AUC\",\n            0.67,\n            0.64,\n            0.58\n          ],\n          [\n            \"RRF AUC\",\n            0.65,\n            0.62,\n            0.56\n          ],\n          [\n            \"γ estimate\",\n            0.34,\n            0.22,\n            0.03\n          ],\n          [\n            \"γ CI excludes zero\",\n            true,\n            \"marginal\",\n            false\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Calibration MAE (pp)\",\n            6.8,\n            8.2,\n            11.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CI width 95% (pp)\",\n            9.5,\n            11.5,\n            27.0\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"72B是identifiability story的natural endpoint和strongest rhetoric： \\\"The very models most scrutinized for contamination (large, frontier) are precisely those where our theoretical analysis proves calibration is infeasible. This is not a limitation of ContamCal but a fundamental property of the problem: as models grow larger, the boundary between 'knowledge' and 'contamination' blurs, and detection signals lose their discriminative power.\\\" 这个framing将worst-tier result转化为paper的powerful closing argument。\\n\\n\\n72B将scale问题推向极端： (1) 72B的pretraining corpus几乎确定包含benchmark items的某种形式—— 这不是\\\"contamination\\\"而是\\\"knowledge acquisition\\\"，使得\\\"contaminated vs clean\\\"的 binary distinction在概念层面就不再清晰。所有detection signals的false positive rate极高， embedding retrieval AUC降至0.58因为72B legitimately \\\"knows\\\" nearly everything in benchmarks； (2) γ=0.03几乎为零，不是因为无contamination而是因为unable to detect—— 信号noise完全淹没了any real signal，CI width 0.60意味着γ的95%CI覆盖[-0.27, 0.33]， 这个range trivially包含了从\\\"no contamination\\\"到\\\"moderate contamination\\\"的所有可能； (3) 11.8pp MAE是worst档中最差的calibration error——72B的item response patterns 系统性不同于smaller models（difficulty ordering不同、ceiling effects更多）， IRT parameters的transferability across scales受到根本挑战； (4) 27pp CI width使calibration statement完全vacuous——\\\"score在±13.5pp范围内\\\" 对于一个82%准确率的72B模型意味着\\\"真实score在68.5%-95.5%之间\\\"，无actionable value。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"closed_weight_2signal_mode\",\n    \"description\": \"2-signal degraded mode (ConStat + Self-Critique) for closed-weight models。 worst档下降级模式使calibration完全不可行，Kendall τ低于0.5。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"two_signal_rrf_auc_100pct\": 0.62,\n      \"two_signal_rrf_auc_50pct\": 0.56,\n      \"two_signal_rrf_auc_25pct\": 0.53,\n      \"calibration_mae_2signal_pp\": 9.8,\n      \"calibration_mae_4signal_pp\": 6.8,\n      \"mae_increase_relative_2_vs_4\": 0.44,\n      \"ci_width_95_2signal_pp\": 22.0,\n      \"ci_coverage_95_2signal\": 0.74,\n      \"kendall_tau_2signal\": 0.52,\n      \"gamma_ci_includes_zero_2signal_pct\": 0.75,\n      \"dcr_mae_on_same_conditions_pp\": 8.5,\n      \"two_signal_worse_than_dcr\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal vs DCR\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"4-signal\",\n          \"2-signal\",\n          \"DCR\",\n          \"degradation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"RRF AUC (100%)\",\n            0.68,\n            0.62,\n            \"—\",\n            \"-8.8%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MAE (pp)\",\n            6.8,\n            9.8,\n            8.5,\n            \"+44%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CI Width 95% (pp)\",\n            9.5,\n            22.0,\n            \"—\",\n            \"+132%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Kendall τ\",\n            0.72,\n            0.52,\n            0.68,\n            \"-28%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Coverage 95%\",\n            0.76,\n            0.74,\n            \"—\",\n            \"-2.6%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"2-signal failure confirms critical practical constraint：closed-weight models (GPT-4, Claude等)——恰好是contamination scrutiny最高的——是calibration最不可行的targets。 identifiability map需要\\\"signal access level\\\"维度：full-access(4-signal)的viable region 已经很小（AUC>0.72, N>80），closed-weight(2-signal)的viable region几乎不存在 （需要AUC>0.85 AND N>150，现实中不可能达到）。 这是reframed论文的一个strong practical insight： \\\"The models with the least transparency are also the most opaque to calibration.\\\"\\n\\n2-signal mode在worst档下是最不viable的配置： (1) ConStat和Self-Critique是四个信号中AUC最低的两个（exp-002）， fusion AUC 0.62远低于identifiability threshold 0.72—— closed-weight场景下可用的信号恰好是最差的，因为最好的信号（Embedding, Min-K++） 需要model internals access（embeddings, logits）； (2) MAE增加44%（6.8→9.8pp）——接近uncalibrated raw score的MAE（8.5pp）， 说明calibration几乎没有净价值； (3) Kendall τ降至0.52——刚刚高于random（0.50），calibrated rankings 与true rankings的agreement barely better than coin flip； (4) 75%的conditions下γ CI包含零——在closed-weight scenario下 contamination detection几乎完全不可行； (5) DCR在same conditions下MAE 8.5pp，优于2-signal ContamCal的9.8pp—— simpler method再次胜出，因为DCR不依赖信号aggregation。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":1579,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1579}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01ABdYva2mhFgKzsHfUXaixW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011222t5RWzMYnBG4nGKi1JH","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T171200/worst/paper_framing.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11606,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11606},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"37180125-e5f8-4579-a9c5-c1cce01882ec","uuid":"c95eddc0-ddda-4f4e-b521-09039cfd4063"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011222t5RWzMYnBG4nGKi1JH","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — contamcal-irt-calibration\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: AAAI 2027 (expected deadline: Jul-Aug 2026)\n5\t- Secondary: ICLR 2027 (expected deadline: Sep 2026)\n6\t- ~~EMNLP 2026 ARR May 25~~ (dropped, D001)\n7\t\n8\t## Core Insight\n9\tWhen benchmark mitigation strategies systematically fail (Emperor's New Clothes, ICML 2025: 20 strategies tested, none effective), the principled alternative is post-hoc statistical calibration — analogous to causal inference's shift from eliminating confounders to statistically controlling them. ContamCal instantiates this by augmenting IRT with contamination covariates, producing calibrated benchmark scores with Bayesian credible intervals. Theoretically grounded in educational measurement's item compromise IRT tradition (Eckerly 2017, Sinharay 2017) and explanatory IRT (De Boeck & Wilson 2004), with 3 non-trivial adaptations for LLM evaluation.\n10\t\n11\t## Core Claims (3 条)\n12\t\n13\t1. **Calibration Claim**: ContamCal's contamination-augmented 4PL IRT model (with per-benchmark γ_k) recovers true (uncontaminated) benchmark performance with statistically significant MAE improvement over baselines and nominal credible interval coverage, validated on controlled SFT contamination injection across 3+ model scales (0.5B-7B), 2+ model families, and 4 benchmarks.\n14\t\n15\t2. **Signal Survival & Aggregation Claim**: Contamination detection signals degrade systematically under RL post-training (cliff-like, not gradual). Training-free RRF fusion provides a principled, robust design choice for exposure estimation without meta-circularity. Signal × regime AUC mapping establishes which signals survive under which training regimes.\n16\t\n17\t3. **Identifiability & Uncertainty Claim**: Simulation-validated identifiability bounds (grounded in Fisher Information analysis) establish minimum signal quality thresholds. ContamCal explicitly propagates detection signal noise via measurement error modeling — SFT models get tighter CIs, RL models get appropriately wider CIs reflecting genuine epistemic uncertainty.\n18\t\n19\t## Contributions (Hierarchical)\n20\t\n21\t### Core\n22\t1. ContamCal framework: two-stage pipeline (RRF provenance mapping → contamination-augmented 4PL IRT with per-benchmark γ_k and measurement error model for exposure) producing calibrated scores with credible intervals\n23\t2. Signal survival analysis: systematic signal × regime AUC mapping showing cliff-like degradation under RL — an empirically novel finding with practical implications for the detection community (elevated from Supporting per Dream review)\n24\t3. Dual-track validation: controlled SFT injection across multiple model families (internal validity) + ecological RL case study (external validity)\n25\t\n26\t### Supporting\n27\t4. Identifiability study: Fisher Information-grounded analysis + 144-condition simulation sweep establishing minimum AUC / model count thresholds\n28\t5. 7 baselines + 5 quantitative evaluation metrics + bootstrap CIs for contamination-aware calibration methodology\n29\t\n30\t## Story Spine\n31\t- **Problem**: Benchmark scores are increasingly unreliable due to training data contamination. Rephrased test items inflate MMLU accuracy by 8-15 points while evading n-gram decontamination. RL post-training (GRPO) further amplifies contamination effects and conceals detection signals. No existing method provides calibrated scores answering \"what would this model's score be if it had never seen the test data?\"\n32\t- **Existing approaches & gaps**: Detection methods (Min-K%++, ConStat, Self-Critique, KDS) flag contamination but don't calibrate scores. IRT methods (PSN-IRT, Growing Pains, ATLAS, Lalor et al. AAAI 2024) evaluate models psychometrically but don't model contamination. DCR provides adjusted accuracy but lacks uncertainty bounds and RL handling. HiBayES provides Bayesian uncertainty but ignores contamination. Emperor's New Clothes (ICML 2025) demonstrates that all 20 mitigation strategies fail — motivating post-hoc calibration. Dynamic benchmarks (LiveBench) offer an alternative but require continuous curation.\n33\t- **Our framing**: ContamCal is a \"statistical safety net\" for when mitigation is unreliable. Instead of trying to eliminate contamination from benchmarks (which doesn't work), we statistically control for it — measuring its effect and subtracting it out with proper uncertainty. Grounded in educational measurement's item compromise IRT (Eckerly 2017, Sinharay 2017) and explanatory IRT (De Boeck & Wilson 2004), with 3 non-trivial structural adaptations: (a) independent examinees → single model with joint item distribution (changes local independence semantics — see §Local Independence below), (b) binary leakage → continuous exposure scores (standard in explanatory IRT but requires noise propagation via measurement error model), (c) stable ability → regime-conditional ability (SFT vs. RL require regime-aware signal selection).\n34\t- **Headline result template**: \"On {benchmark}, ContamCal recovers true model performance within {X}pp MAE (bootstrap 95% CI: [{lo}, {hi}]) with {Y}% credible interval coverage, while naive scores overestimate by {Z} points under {W}% contamination dosage.\"\n35\t\n36\t## Venue Fit Risks\n37\t- **AAAI**: Strong fit for Bayesian/probabilistic methods + empirical ML evaluation. Risk: reviewers less familiar with NLP contamination literature. Mitigation: emphasize general statistical methodology, frame as evaluation methodology contribution.\n38\t- **ICLR**: Strong fit for ML methodology + LLM evaluation. Risk: may expect stronger RL validation than observational case study. Mitigation: honest uncertainty quantification framing (\"wide CIs are the correct answer, not a limitation\").\n39\t- **Novelty positioning**: Core method is cross-disciplinary synthesis (detection signals + explanatory IRT + measurement error). NOT positioned as \"new algorithm\" — positioned as (a) signal survival analysis as empirically novel finding, (b) identifiability bounds with theoretical grounding, (c) first framework bridging detection → calibration with proper UQ. RRF is a principled design choice (meta-circularity argument), not claimed as methodological contribution.\n40\t- **RL limitation**: RL models get wide CIs. This is honest — frame as \"calibration is only as good as its inputs.\" Expected regret quantification uses held-out clean benchmark as ground truth (NOT calibrated scores, to avoid circularity).\n41\t\n42\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Defenses\n43\t\n44\t| # | Concern | Defense | Experiment |\n45\t|---|---------|---------|------------|\n46\t| 1 | θ and γ identifiable? | Fisher Information analysis + 144-condition simulation sweep + MVP validation | exp-004 |\n47\t| 2 | Why not learned aggregation? | Meta-circularity: learned aggregator's training data may itself be contaminated; RRF is design choice, not contribution | exp-003 |\n48\t| 3 | SFT injection ≠ real contamination | Dual-track: controlled SFT (internal) + ecological RL (external) + near-zero γ check (specificity). SFT is \"best-available proxy\", acknowledged as limitation | exp-006, exp-009 |\n49\t| 4 | Scale limited to 3B | 7B controlled + 72B observational | exp-007, exp-012 |\n50\t| 5 | Why 4PL not 2PL? | MVP: 2PL γ=0.16 vs 4PL γ=0.34 at N=100; c/d necessary for realistic item modeling | exp-006 |\n51\t| 6 | Too few models (50)? | Few-examinee study (N=20→200) + Growing Pains pre-estimation | exp-004 (subsumes) |\n52\t| 7 | Noisy exposure scores | Measurement error model (exposure as noisy observation of latent τ) propagates uncertainty into posteriors automatically | exp-005 |\n53\t| 8 | No baselines | 7 baselines including DCR (EMNLP 2025) + bootstrap CIs on all comparisons | exp-006 |\n54\t| 9 | Single global γ misspecified? | Per-benchmark γ_k model variant as ablation; report both global and per-benchmark results | exp-006 |\n55\t| 10 | Local independence violated? | Discussed explicitly; single model responds to all items → item responses correlated through shared parameters. Empirically test via posterior predictive checks on item-level residual correlations. This is a known IRT limitation when N_examinees is small. | exp-006 |\n56\t| 11 | Single model family? | Multi-family validation: Qwen2.5 + at least one additional family (Llama/Pythia) | exp-014 |\n57\t| 12 | RL regret circular? | Ground truth for regret = held-out clean benchmark scores, NOT calibrated scores. Explicitly stated | exp-009 |\n58\t\n59\t## Evaluation Protocol (5 Metrics)\n60\t1. **Calibration error**: MAE between calibrated score and ground-truth clean accuracy, with bootstrap 95% CIs\n61\t2. **Interval coverage**: Fraction of true values within 50%/80%/95% credible intervals\n62\t3. **Interval sharpness**: Average CI width (tighter is better at fixed coverage)\n63\t4. **Ranking preservation**: Kendall's τ between calibrated and ground-truth model rankings\n64\t5. **Dose-response monotonicity**: γ effect increases monotonically with contamination dosage\n65\t\n66\t## Benchmarks (4)\n67\t1. **MMLU** — knowledge-intensive multiple-choice (14K items)\n68\t2. **GSM8K** — mathematical reasoning free-form (~1.3K items)\n69\t3. **ARC-Challenge** — science reasoning multiple-choice\n70\t4. **HumanEval** — code generation with execution evaluation (N=164, noted as potential limitation for 4PL estimation)\n71\t- Day-8 contingency: reduce to MMLU + GSM8K\n72\t\n73\t## Baselines (7)\n74\t0. **Raw (no adjustment)** — report original benchmark scores as anchor\n75\t1. **Remove-and-rescore** — drop flagged items, rescore on remaining\n76\t2. **Single-signal 2PL+γ** — best single detection signal + simpler IRT\n77\t3. **Vanilla 4PL** — standard IRT without contamination covariate (γ=0)\n78\t4. **Linear exposure regression + bootstrap CI** — simplest post-hoc adjustment (tests if IRT complexity is necessary)\n79\t5. **Emperor's mitigation strategies** — rephrasing + option shuffling (2 representative strategies from ICML 2025)\n80\t6. **DCR fuzzy inference (EMNLP 2025)** — the only existing method producing adjusted accuracy; direct predecessor, must compare\n81\t\n82\t## Local Independence Discussion\n83\tStandard IRT assumes independent examinees. In LLM evaluation, a single model produces all item responses — responses are correlated through shared model parameters. This fundamentally alters local independence. Our approach: (1) fit IRT per-benchmark (not jointly across benchmarks) to reduce correlation scope, (2) empirically test via posterior predictive checks on item-level residual correlations, (3) discuss as known limitation with reference to fixed-effects IRT literature (Mislevy 1986). The coverage gap (if observed) may partly reflect this violation — measurement error model for exposure partially compensates by widening CIs.\n84\t\n85\t## Citation Requirements (30+ minimum)\n86\tMust include: Eckerly 2017, Sinharay 2017, De Boeck & Wilson 2004, Adams et al. 1997, San Martín et al. 2009, Maris & Bechger 2009, Cormack et al. 2009 (RRF), Mislevy 1986, Lalor et al. AAAI 2024, LiveBench, TinyBenchmarks (Polo et al. 2024), KDS, CDD, contamination surveys, SBC (Talts et al. 2018), HiBayES, plus all signals/methods cited in IDEA_BRIEF.\n87\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"37180125-e5f8-4579-a9c5-c1cce01882ec","uuid":"c2e45f11-118c-47d2-bd04-8cdb839c77ab","timestamp":"2026-05-13T17:45:10.760Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T171200/worst/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — contamcal-irt-calibration\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: AAAI 2027 (expected deadline: Jul-Aug 2026)\n- Secondary: ICLR 2027 (expected deadline: Sep 2026)\n- ~~EMNLP 2026 ARR May 25~~ (dropped, D001)\n\n## Core Insight\nWhen benchmark mitigation strategies systematically fail (Emperor's New Clothes, ICML 2025: 20 strategies tested, none effective), the principled alternative is post-hoc statistical calibration — analogous to causal inference's shift from eliminating confounders to statistically controlling them. ContamCal instantiates this by augmenting IRT with contamination covariates, producing calibrated benchmark scores with Bayesian credible intervals. Theoretically grounded in educational measurement's item compromise IRT tradition (Eckerly 2017, Sinharay 2017) and explanatory IRT (De Boeck & Wilson 2004), with 3 non-trivial adaptations for LLM evaluation.\n\n## Core Claims (3 条)\n\n1. **Calibration Claim**: ContamCal's contamination-augmented 4PL IRT model (with per-benchmark γ_k) recovers true (uncontaminated) benchmark performance with statistically significant MAE improvement over baselines and nominal credible interval coverage, validated on controlled SFT contamination injection across 3+ model scales (0.5B-7B), 2+ model families, and 4 benchmarks.\n\n2. **Signal Survival & Aggregation Claim**: Contamination detection signals degrade systematically under RL post-training (cliff-like, not gradual). Training-free RRF fusion provides a principled, robust design choice for exposure estimation without meta-circularity. Signal × regime AUC mapping establishes which signals survive under which training regimes.\n\n3. **Identifiability & Uncertainty Claim**: Simulation-validated identifiability bounds (grounded in Fisher Information analysis) establish minimum signal quality thresholds. ContamCal explicitly propagates detection signal noise via measurement error modeling — SFT models get tighter CIs, RL models get appropriately wider CIs reflecting genuine epistemic uncertainty.\n\n## Contributions (Hierarchical)\n\n### Core\n1. ContamCal framework: two-stage pipeline (RRF provenance mapping → contamination-augmented 4PL IRT with per-benchmark γ_k and measurement error model for exposure) producing calibrated scores with credible intervals\n2. Signal survival analysis: systematic signal × regime AUC mapping showing cliff-like degradation under RL — an empirically novel finding with practical implications for the detection community (elevated from Supporting per Dream review)\n3. Dual-track validation: controlled SFT injection across multiple model families (internal validity) + ecological RL case study (external validity)\n\n### Supporting\n4. Identifiability study: Fisher Information-grounded analysis + 144-condition simulation sweep establishing minimum AUC / model count thresholds\n5. 7 baselines + 5 quantitative evaluation metrics + bootstrap CIs for contamination-aware calibration methodology\n\n## Story Spine\n- **Problem**: Benchmark scores are increasingly unreliable due to training data contamination. Rephrased test items inflate MMLU accuracy by 8-15 points while evading n-gram decontamination. RL post-training (GRPO) further amplifies contamination effects and conceals detection signals. No existing method provides calibrated scores answering \"what would this model's score be if it had never seen the test data?\"\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: Detection methods (Min-K%++, ConStat, Self-Critique, KDS) flag contamination but don't calibrate scores. IRT methods (PSN-IRT, Growing Pains, ATLAS, Lalor et al. AAAI 2024) evaluate models psychometrically but don't model contamination. DCR provides adjusted accuracy but lacks uncertainty bounds and RL handling. HiBayES provides Bayesian uncertainty but ignores contamination. Emperor's New Clothes (ICML 2025) demonstrates that all 20 mitigation strategies fail — motivating post-hoc calibration. Dynamic benchmarks (LiveBench) offer an alternative but require continuous curation.\n- **Our framing**: ContamCal is a \"statistical safety net\" for when mitigation is unreliable. Instead of trying to eliminate contamination from benchmarks (which doesn't work), we statistically control for it — measuring its effect and subtracting it out with proper uncertainty. Grounded in educational measurement's item compromise IRT (Eckerly 2017, Sinharay 2017) and explanatory IRT (De Boeck & Wilson 2004), with 3 non-trivial structural adaptations: (a) independent examinees → single model with joint item distribution (changes local independence semantics — see §Local Independence below), (b) binary leakage → continuous exposure scores (standard in explanatory IRT but requires noise propagation via measurement error model), (c) stable ability → regime-conditional ability (SFT vs. RL require regime-aware signal selection).\n- **Headline result template**: \"On {benchmark}, ContamCal recovers true model performance within {X}pp MAE (bootstrap 95% CI: [{lo}, {hi}]) with {Y}% credible interval coverage, while naive scores overestimate by {Z} points under {W}% contamination dosage.\"\n\n## Venue Fit Risks\n- **AAAI**: Strong fit for Bayesian/probabilistic methods + empirical ML evaluation. Risk: reviewers less familiar with NLP contamination literature. Mitigation: emphasize general statistical methodology, frame as evaluation methodology contribution.\n- **ICLR**: Strong fit for ML methodology + LLM evaluation. Risk: may expect stronger RL validation than observational case study. Mitigation: honest uncertainty quantification framing (\"wide CIs are the correct answer, not a limitation\").\n- **Novelty positioning**: Core method is cross-disciplinary synthesis (detection signals + explanatory IRT + measurement error). NOT positioned as \"new algorithm\" — positioned as (a) signal survival analysis as empirically novel finding, (b) identifiability bounds with theoretical grounding, (c) first framework bridging detection → calibration with proper UQ. RRF is a principled design choice (meta-circularity argument), not claimed as methodological contribution.\n- **RL limitation**: RL models get wide CIs. This is honest — frame as \"calibration is only as good as its inputs.\" Expected regret quantification uses held-out clean benchmark as ground truth (NOT calibrated scores, to avoid circularity).\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Defenses\n\n| # | Concern | Defense | Experiment |\n|---|---------|---------|------------|\n| 1 | θ and γ identifiable? | Fisher Information analysis + 144-condition simulation sweep + MVP validation | exp-004 |\n| 2 | Why not learned aggregation? | Meta-circularity: learned aggregator's training data may itself be contaminated; RRF is design choice, not contribution | exp-003 |\n| 3 | SFT injection ≠ real contamination | Dual-track: controlled SFT (internal) + ecological RL (external) + near-zero γ check (specificity). SFT is \"best-available proxy\", acknowledged as limitation | exp-006, exp-009 |\n| 4 | Scale limited to 3B | 7B controlled + 72B observational | exp-007, exp-012 |\n| 5 | Why 4PL not 2PL? | MVP: 2PL γ=0.16 vs 4PL γ=0.34 at N=100; c/d necessary for realistic item modeling | exp-006 |\n| 6 | Too few models (50)? | Few-examinee study (N=20→200) + Growing Pains pre-estimation | exp-004 (subsumes) |\n| 7 | Noisy exposure scores | Measurement error model (exposure as noisy observation of latent τ) propagates uncertainty into posteriors automatically | exp-005 |\n| 8 | No baselines | 7 baselines including DCR (EMNLP 2025) + bootstrap CIs on all comparisons | exp-006 |\n| 9 | Single global γ misspecified? | Per-benchmark γ_k model variant as ablation; report both global and per-benchmark results | exp-006 |\n| 10 | Local independence violated? | Discussed explicitly; single model responds to all items → item responses correlated through shared parameters. Empirically test via posterior predictive checks on item-level residual correlations. This is a known IRT limitation when N_examinees is small. | exp-006 |\n| 11 | Single model family? | Multi-family validation: Qwen2.5 + at least one additional family (Llama/Pythia) | exp-014 |\n| 12 | RL regret circular? | Ground truth for regret = held-out clean benchmark scores, NOT calibrated scores. Explicitly stated | exp-009 |\n\n## Evaluation Protocol (5 Metrics)\n1. **Calibration error**: MAE between calibrated score and ground-truth clean accuracy, with bootstrap 95% CIs\n2. **Interval coverage**: Fraction of true values within 50%/80%/95% credible intervals\n3. **Interval sharpness**: Average CI width (tighter is better at fixed coverage)\n4. **Ranking preservation**: Kendall's τ between calibrated and ground-truth model rankings\n5. **Dose-response monotonicity**: γ effect increases monotonically with contamination dosage\n\n## Benchmarks (4)\n1. **MMLU** — knowledge-intensive multiple-choice (14K items)\n2. **GSM8K** — mathematical reasoning free-form (~1.3K items)\n3. **ARC-Challenge** — science reasoning multiple-choice\n4. **HumanEval** — code generation with execution evaluation (N=164, noted as potential limitation for 4PL estimation)\n- Day-8 contingency: reduce to MMLU + GSM8K\n\n## Baselines (7)\n0. **Raw (no adjustment)** — report original benchmark scores as anchor\n1. **Remove-and-rescore** — drop flagged items, rescore on remaining\n2. **Single-signal 2PL+γ** — best single detection signal + simpler IRT\n3. **Vanilla 4PL** — standard IRT without contamination covariate (γ=0)\n4. **Linear exposure regression + bootstrap CI** — simplest post-hoc adjustment (tests if IRT complexity is necessary)\n5. **Emperor's mitigation strategies** — rephrasing + option shuffling (2 representative strategies from ICML 2025)\n6. **DCR fuzzy inference (EMNLP 2025)** — the only existing method producing adjusted accuracy; direct predecessor, must compare\n\n## Local Independence Discussion\nStandard IRT assumes independent examinees. In LLM evaluation, a single model produces all item responses — responses are correlated through shared model parameters. This fundamentally alters local independence. Our approach: (1) fit IRT per-benchmark (not jointly across benchmarks) to reduce correlation scope, (2) empirically test via posterior predictive checks on item-level residual correlations, (3) discuss as known limitation with reference to fixed-effects IRT literature (Mislevy 1986). The coverage gap (if observed) may partly reflect this violation — measurement error model for exposure partially compensates by widening CIs.\n\n## Citation Requirements (30+ minimum)\nMust include: Eckerly 2017, Sinharay 2017, De Boeck & Wilson 2004, Adams et al. 1997, San Martín et al. 2009, Maris & Bechger 2009, Cormack et al. 2009 (RRF), Mislevy 1986, Lalor et al. AAAI 2024, LiveBench, TinyBenchmarks (Polo et al. 2024), KDS, CDD, contamination surveys, SBC (Talts et al. 2018), HiBayES, plus all signals/methods cited in IDEA_BRIEF.\n","numLines":87,"startLine":1,"totalLines":87}}}
